window.SVR_LANGS={"es":{"MOCKUP: free-licence example photos. [ ] = real workshop details to come.":"MAQUETA: fotos de ejemplo con licencia libre. [ ] = datos reales del taller por llegar.","Services":"Servicios","Process":"Proceso","Standards":"Estándares","Reviews":"Reseñas","Contact":"Contacto","Flawless":"Acabado","finish.":"impecable.","Every panel.":"En cada panel.","Refined over 20 years. Finished to perfection.":"Más de 20 años de oficio. Acabado perfecto.","Car body repair and paint in Jersey, for dents, scratches and accident damage. Colour matched to your paint code, finished so you cannot find the repair, and guaranteed in writing.":"Reparación de carrocería y pintura en Jersey: abolladuras, arañazos y daños por accidente. Color igualado a tu código de pintura, tan bien terminado que no se nota la reparación, y con garantía por escrito.","Get a free estimate":"Pide presupuesto gratis","WhatsApp your photos":"Envía tus fotos por WhatsApp","Call [01534 000000]":"Llama al [01534 000000]","Scratch repair":"Reparación de arañazos","Dent removal":"Reparación de abolladuras","Full respray":"Repintado completo","Accident repair":"Reparación por accidente","Colour matching":"Igualación de color","Alloy wheels":"Llantas de aleación","Polishing":"Pulido","Whatever happened to your car":"Pase lo que pase con tu coche","Send us a photo and we will tell you plainly what it needs. Sometimes that is a small repair, not a respray.":"Envíanos una foto y te diremos con claridad qué necesita. A veces es una reparación pequeña, no un repintado.","Dents without the respray":"Abolladuras sin repintar","Paintless dent removal where the paint is unbroken. Panel work where it is not.":"Quitamos la abolladura sin repintar si la pintura está intacta. Si no lo está, trabajamos el panel.","From [£000]":"Desde [£000]","Accident and bumper repair":"Reparación de accidentes y parachoques","Prepared, primed and painted in a controlled booth, then handled with your insurer if you wish.":"Preparado, imprimado y pintado en cabina controlada, y si quieres nos encargamos del seguro.","Free estimate":"Presupuesto gratis","Polish and protect":"Pulido y protección","Swirl marks, faded lacquer and light scratches brought back to a mirror shine.":"Marcas circulares, barniz apagado y arañazos leves recuperan un brillo de espejo.","[Confirm with the workshop which services it really offers, and prices.]":"[Confirmar con el taller qué servicios ofrece de verdad y los precios.]","Not your fault? We deal with the insurer.":"¿No fue tu culpa? Nosotros tratamos con el seguro.","If someone else caused the damage, you should not have to chase anyone. We send the photos and the estimate to the insurers, handle the back and forth, and keep you updated until your car is home.":"Si otra persona causó el daño, no deberías tener que perseguir a nadie. Enviamos las fotos y el presupuesto a las aseguradoras, gestionamos la ida y vuelta y te mantenemos informado hasta que tu coche esté en casa.","In most cases you can choose who repairs your car":"En la mayoría de los casos puedes elegir quién repara tu coche","Photos and a written estimate sent straight to the insurer":"Fotos y presupuesto por escrito enviados directamente a la aseguradora","Updates by WhatsApp until the job is done":"Novedades por WhatsApp hasta terminar el trabajo","Tell us what happened":"Cuéntanos qué pasó","[Confirm SVR offers insurance claims handling, and check the wording with a Jersey insurer.]":"[Confirmar que SVR ofrece la gestión de seguros y revisar el texto con una aseguradora de Jersey.]","How your car comes back perfect":"Así vuelve tu coche perfecto","Scroll to follow a repair from the first look to the keys in your hand.":"Baja para seguir una reparación, desde la primera revisión hasta tener las llaves en la mano.","Step 1":"Paso 1","We look, you get a price":"Lo revisamos y te damos un precio","Send photos or drop in. You receive a clear written estimate, usually within [one working day], with no obligation.":"Envía fotos o pásate por el taller. Recibes un presupuesto claro por escrito, normalmente en [un día laborable], sin compromiso.","Step 2":"Paso 2","Strip back and repair":"Desmontaje y reparación","Dents are pulled, rust is cut out, and the panel is prepared properly. This is where most of a good finish is won.":"Se sacan las abolladuras, se corta el óxido y se prepara bien el panel. Aquí se gana la mayor parte de un buen acabado.","Step 3":"Paso 3","Your exact colour":"Tu color exacto","Mixed to your paint code and tested on a spray-out card beside the car, then blended into the next panel.":"Se mezcla con tu código de pintura y se prueba en una tarjeta junto al coche; luego se funde con el panel de al lado.","Step 4":"Paso 4","Baked in the booth":"Horneado en cabina","Dust-free spraying, then heat curing for a hard, glossy lacquer that lasts.":"Pintado sin polvo y curado con calor para un barniz duro, brillante y duradero.","Step 5":"Paso 5","Polished by hand and machine":"Pulido a mano y a máquina","Every panel is checked in bright light and polished until the repair disappears.":"Cada panel se revisa con luz intensa y se pule hasta que la reparación desaparece.","Step 6":"Paso 6","Collect it, guaranteed":"Recógelo, con garantía","Cleaned inside and out, with a written guarantee. [Guarantee terms to confirm.]":"Limpio por dentro y por fuera, con garantía por escrito. [Condiciones de la garantía por confirmar.]","Before":"Antes","After":"Después","Demo effect on a stock photo. Replace with the workshop’s own before and after photos, with each owner’s permission.":"Efecto de demostración sobre una foto de stock. Sustituir por fotos de antes y después del propio taller, con permiso de cada dueño.","See the difference":"Mira la diferencia","Drag across the car. Our job is to make the repair impossible to find: same colour, same gloss, same finish as the factory.":"Arrastra sobre el coche. Nuestro trabajo es que la reparación sea imposible de encontrar: mismo color, mismo brillo, mismo acabado que de fábrica.","Get yours looked at":"Que revisen el tuyo","Buying a used car? Check it first.":"¿Vas a comprar un coche usado? Revísalo primero.","A clean history does not mean a clean car. Hidden repairs, filler and resprays only show up when someone measures the paint.":"Un historial limpio no significa un coche limpio. Las reparaciones ocultas, la masilla y los repintados solo se descubren cuando alguien mide la pintura.","Pre-purchase bodywork inspection":"Inspección de carrocería antes de comprar","Before you buy, we check every panel with a paint thickness gauge and inspect the car in bright light. You get a short written report with photos, so you know exactly what you are paying for.":"Antes de comprar, revisamos cada panel con un medidor de espesor de pintura e inspeccionamos el coche con luz intensa. Recibes un informe corto por escrito con fotos, para saber exactamente qué estás pagando.","[Price to confirm with SVR]":"[Precio por confirmar con SVR]","Example reading, for illustration":"Lectura de ejemplo, solo ilustrativa","paint depth (µm)":"espesor de pintura (µm)","Bonnet":"Capó","Front wing":"Aleta delantera","Front door":"Puerta delantera","Rear door":"Puerta trasera","Roof":"Techo","A much thicker reading on one panel usually means it has been repainted.":"Una lectura mucho más gruesa en un panel suele indicar que ha sido repintado.","Book an inspection":"Reservar una inspección","See SVR Car Check":"Ver SVR Car Check","Online history check":"Historial en línea","A history report can show outstanding finance, past write-offs and mileage records, from UK databases.":"Un informe de historial puede mostrar deudas pendientes, siniestros totales anteriores y registros de kilometraje, con datos del Reino Unido.","Best for cars with a previous UK registration":"Ideal para coches con una matrícula anterior del Reino Unido","Paid service, run by a third party":"Servicio de pago, de un tercero","Check a history online":"Consultar un historial en línea","Opens carVertical, an independent website. SVR is not responsible for its reports. [Confirm which provider SVR wants to recommend.]":"Abre carVertical, una web independiente. SVR no se hace responsable de sus informes. [Confirmar qué proveedor quiere recomendar SVR.]","Our standards":"Nuestros estándares","You expect a repair you cannot spot, and a workshop that keeps its word. This is what we commit to on every job.":"Esperas una reparación que no se note y un taller que cumple su palabra. Esto es lo que prometemos en cada trabajo.","A written, itemised estimate":"Presupuesto escrito y detallado","The price is agreed before any work starts. If anything changes, we ask you first.":"El precio se acuerda antes de empezar. Si algo cambia, te preguntamos primero.","Colour matched to your paint code":"Color igualado a tu código de pintura","Checked on a spray-out card in daylight and blended into the neighbouring panel.":"Comprobado en una tarjeta de prueba a la luz del día y fundido con el panel vecino.","Progress updates":"Avisos del avance","Photos and a message at each stage, by WhatsApp or phone. [To confirm.]":"Fotos y un mensaje en cada etapa, por WhatsApp o teléfono. [Por confirmar.]","Honest advice":"Consejo honesto","If a smaller repair will do, we will tell you, even when it costs us the bigger job.":"Si basta una reparación menor, te lo decimos, aunque nos cueste el trabajo más grande.","Inspected before handover":"Revisado antes de la entrega","Every panel is checked under bright light before we call you.":"Cada panel se comprueba con luz intensa antes de llamarte.","Guaranteed in writing":"Garantía por escrito","[Guarantee terms to confirm with SVR.]":"[Condiciones de la garantía por confirmar con SVR.]","[Insurer approvals, if held]":"[Aprobaciones de aseguradoras, si las hay]","[Trade body membership, if held]":"[Pertenencia a asociaciones del sector, si la hay]","[Manufacturer paint system, if used]":"[Sistema de pintura del fabricante, si se usa]","Only show an accreditation once SVR can prove it. Better a short, true list than a long one.":"Mostrar una acreditación solo cuando SVR pueda demostrarla. Mejor una lista corta y verdadera que una larga.","years of experience":"años de experiencia","vehicles repaired [to confirm]":"vehículos reparados [por confirmar]","average Google rating [to confirm]":"nota media en Google [por confirmar]","parishes covered":"parroquias cubiertas","Made for Jersey roads":"Hecho para las carreteras de Jersey","Narrow lanes, hedges, coastal car parks and salt in the air. We see the same problems all year, and we know how to fix them.":"Caminos estrechos, setos, aparcamientos junto al mar y sal en el aire. Vemos los mismos problemas todo el año y sabemos arreglarlos.","Hedge scrapes":"Roces con setos","Fine scratches along one side. Often polish out; deeper ones need paint.":"Arañazos finos a un lado. A menudo salen con pulido; los más hondos necesitan pintura.","Salt-air rust":"Óxido por aire salado","Small bubbles near wheel arches and sills. Fix them early, before they spread.":"Pequeñas burbujas cerca de los pasos de rueda y los estribos. Hay que arreglarlas pronto, antes de que se extiendan.","Car-park dings":"Golpes de aparcamiento","Shallow dents with unbroken paint can often be pushed out without a respray.":"Las abolladuras poco profundas con pintura intacta a menudo se sacan sin repintar.","20+ years. Run by the people who do the work":"Más de 20 años. Dirigido por quienes hacen el trabajo","SVR (Sienna Vehicle Refinishing) is owned and run by Guillermo Goveia and Gabriel Das Neves. When you bring your car in, you deal with them directly, from the estimate to the final check.":"SVR (Sienna Vehicle Refinishing) es propiedad de Guillermo Goveia y Gabriel Das Neves, que también la dirigen. Cuando traes tu coche, tratas directamente con ellos, desde el presupuesto hasta la revisión final.","[Add a short line about their background, and a photo of both if they agree.]":"[Añadir una frase sobre su trayectoria y una foto de los dos, si están de acuerdo.]","See the work as it happens":"Mira el trabajo mientras ocurre","Fresh jobs from the spray booth, before and afters, and the odd classic. Follow SVR on Instagram.":"Trabajos recién salidos de la cabina, antes y después, y algún clásico. Sigue a SVR en Instagram.","Follow @svrje2023":"Seguir a @svrje2023","Post shown as published on SVR’s Instagram. [Swap in more posts, or a live feed, later.]":"Publicación tal como aparece en el Instagram de SVR. [Añadir más publicaciones o un feed en vivo más adelante.]","What customers say":"Lo que dicen los clientes","Sample wording only. Use real reviews, with permission.":"Solo texto de ejemplo. Usar reseñas reales, con permiso.","“Sample review: I couldn’t tell where the repair was. The colour match was spot on.”":"“Reseña de ejemplo: no pude ver dónde estaba la reparación. El color quedó clavado.”","[Customer name], St Helier":"[Nombre del cliente], St Helier","“Sample review: they dealt with my insurer and kept me updated every day.”":"“Reseña de ejemplo: se encargaron de mi aseguradora y me informaron cada día.”","[Customer name], St Brelade":"[Nombre del cliente], St Brelade","“Sample review: fair price, honest advice, and the car came back spotless.”":"“Reseña de ejemplo: precio justo, consejo honesto y el coche volvió impecable.”","[Customer name], Grouville":"[Nombre del cliente], Grouville","Questions we get asked":"Preguntas frecuentes","Do I have to use my insurer’s repairer?":"¿Tengo que usar el taller que elige mi aseguradora?","[Confirm for Jersey insurers.] In most cases you can choose your own repairer. Check your policy, or ask us and we will help.":"[Confirmar para las aseguradoras de Jersey.] En la mayoría de los casos puedes elegir tu propio taller. Revisa tu póliza o pregúntanos y te ayudamos.","How long will it take?":"¿Cuánto tardará?","Small repairs can take a day or two. Larger jobs depend on parts and damage. We give you a date with your estimate.":"Las reparaciones pequeñas pueden llevar uno o dos días. Los trabajos grandes dependen de las piezas y del daño. Te damos una fecha con el presupuesto.","Will the colour match?":"¿Coincidirá el color?","We use your car’s paint code, test on a spray-out card and blend into neighbouring panels. Paint fades over time, so we match what is on your car now.":"Usamos el código de pintura de tu coche, probamos en una tarjeta y fundimos con los paneles vecinos. La pintura se desvanece con el tiempo, así que igualamos lo que tiene tu coche ahora.","Is the estimate really free?":"¿De verdad es gratis el presupuesto?","Yes, with no obligation. Photos give a good guide; we confirm in person.":"Sí, sin compromiso. Las fotos dan una buena idea; lo confirmamos en persona.","Do you offer a courtesy car?":"¿Ofrecen coche de cortesía?","[Confirm availability.] Ask when you book.":"[Confirmar disponibilidad.] Pregunta al reservar.","Fill this in and press send. WhatsApp opens with your details ready, so you can add photos of the damage in the same chat. We usually reply within [one working day].":"Rellena esto y pulsa enviar. Se abre WhatsApp con tus datos listos, para que añadas fotos del daño en el mismo chat. Solemos responder en [un día laborable].","Start with your registration":"Empieza con tu matrícula","As shown on your Jersey number plate.":"Tal como aparece en tu placa de Jersey.","Car make and model":"Marca y modelo del coche","Your name":"Tu nombre","Phone":"Teléfono","What happened?":"¿Qué pasó?","We use your details only to reply to your enquiry. See our":"Usamos tus datos solo para responder a tu consulta. Consulta nuestro","privacy notice":"aviso de privacidad","Send on WhatsApp":"Enviar por WhatsApp","No WhatsApp?":"¿No tienes WhatsApp?","Send it by email instead":"Envíalo por correo","WhatsApp is opening with your message. Add photos of the damage in the chat, then press send.":"Se está abriendo WhatsApp con tu mensaje. Añade fotos del daño en el chat y pulsa enviar.","Find us":"Dónde estamos","[Address], [Parish], Jersey [JE_ ___]":"[Dirección], [Parroquia], Jersey [JE_ ___]","Monday to Friday":"Lunes a viernes","Saturday":"Sábado","Sunday":"Domingo","Closed":"Cerrado","Map goes here":"Aquí irá el mapa","(free OpenStreetMap)":"(OpenStreetMap, gratis)","Privacy notice":"Aviso de privacidad","Who we are":"Quiénes somos","SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, [address], Jersey [JE_ ___]. Contact: [email@address].":"SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, [dirección], Jersey [JE_ ___]. Contacto: [email@address].","What we collect":"Qué datos recogemos","Why we use it":"Para qué los usamos","To reply to your enquiry, give you an estimate and carry out the repair. We do not sell your details or send marketing without asking first.":"Para responder a tu consulta, darte un presupuesto y hacer la reparación. No vendemos tus datos ni enviamos publicidad sin preguntarte antes.","How long we keep it":"Cuánto tiempo los guardamos","[For example, up to two years after your last job.] Then it is deleted.":"[Por ejemplo, hasta dos años después de tu último trabajo.] Después se borran.","Who else sees it":"Quién más los ve","No one outside SVR, except the services you choose to contact us through. Messages sent by WhatsApp are also handled by WhatsApp (Meta).":"Nadie fuera de SVR, salvo los servicios que elijas para contactarnos. Los mensajes enviados por WhatsApp también los trata WhatsApp (Meta).","Your rights":"Tus derechos","You can ask to see, correct or delete your details at any time. If you are unhappy with how we use them, you can complain to the Jersey Office of the Information Commissioner.":"Puedes pedir ver, corregir o borrar tus datos en cualquier momento. Si no estás conforme con cómo los usamos, puedes reclamar ante la Oficina del Comisionado de Información de Jersey.","This website does not set cookies. It loads its fonts from Google Fonts. [Check before going live.]":"Este sitio web no usa cookies. Carga sus letras desde Google Fonts. [Comprobar antes de publicar.]","[Template only. Have it checked against the Data Protection (Jersey) Law 2018 before the site goes live.]":"[Solo una plantilla. Debe revisarse según la Data Protection (Jersey) Law 2018 antes de publicar el sitio.]","© [Year] SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, Jersey. Owners: Guillermo Goveia and Gabriel Das Neves. [Company registration number].":"© [Año] SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, Jersey. Propietarios: Guillermo Goveia y Gabriel Das Neves. [Número de registro de la empresa].","Book your appointment":"Reserva tu cita","Call":"Llamar","Estimate":"Presupuesto","SVR logo":"Logotipo de SVR","Main":"Principal","SVR painter spraying a red car panel in the spray booth":"Pintor de SVR pintando un panel rojo en la cabina","Technician removing a dent from a car door panel":"Técnico quitando una abolladura de la puerta de un coche","Technician in protective suit spraying a car bumper":"Técnico con traje protector pintando un parachoques","Technician polishing a car panel with a machine":"Técnico puliendo un panel de coche con una máquina","Car before repair (demo effect)":"Coche antes de la reparación (efecto de demostración)","Car after repair":"Coche después de la reparación","Compare before and after":"Comparar antes y después","Example paint thickness reading":"Lectura de ejemplo del espesor de pintura","Accreditations":"Acreditaciones","Parishes we cover":"Parroquias que cubrimos","SVR painter spraying a red panel in the booth":"Pintor de SVR pintando un panel rojo en la cabina","5 stars":"5 estrellas","e.g. Volkswagen Golf":"p. ej. Volkswagen Golf","e.g. scraped the rear door in a car park":"p. ej. me rayaron la puerta trasera en un aparcamiento","MOCKUP: concept page. Sample report only, not a real vehicle. [ ] = to confirm with SVR.":"MAQUETA: página conceptual. Solo informe de ejemplo, no es un vehículo real. [ ] = por confirmar con SVR.","← SVR home":"← Inicio de SVR","Know the car before you buy it.":"Conoce el coche antes de comprarlo.","An independent bodywork and condition report for used cars in Jersey, carried out in person by the team at SVR.":"Un informe independiente de carrocería y estado para coches usados en Jersey, hecho en persona por el equipo de SVR.","Registration of the car you are looking at":"Matrícula del coche que estás viendo","Book a Car Check":"Reservar un Car Check","See a sample report":"Ver un informe de ejemplo","Why in person?":"¿Por qué en persona?","Jersey has no public vehicle history database. Online checks only cover cars with a UK past. So we check what matters most: the car itself.":"Jersey no tiene una base de datos pública del historial de vehículos. Las comprobaciones en línea solo cubren coches con pasado en el Reino Unido. Así que revisamos lo que más importa: el propio coche.","Factory paint":"Pintura de fábrica","Repainted":"Repintado","Filler likely":"Posible masilla","What we check":"Qué revisamos","About [45 minutes] at the seller’s address or at our workshop. [Confirm with SVR.]":"Unos [45 minutos] en casa del vendedor o en nuestro taller. [Confirmar con SVR.]","Paint depth on every panel":"Espesor de pintura en cada panel","Measured with a gauge, to find resprays and hidden repairs.":"Medido con un medidor, para detectar repintados y reparaciones ocultas.","Panel gaps and alignment":"Holguras y alineación de paneles","Uneven gaps often point to an accident repair.":"Las holguras desiguales suelen indicar una reparación por accidente.","Signs of accident damage":"Señales de daños por accidente","Overspray, replaced panels, welds and filler.":"Pintura pulverizada de más, paneles cambiados, soldaduras y masilla.","Rust from salt air":"Óxido por el aire salado","Sills, wheel arches and underside, where island cars suffer most.":"Umbrales, pasos de rueda y bajos, donde más sufren los coches de la isla.","Identity matches the paperwork":"La identidad coincide con los papeles","VIN on the car compared with the registration document (VRD1).":"El número de bastidor (VIN) del coche se compara con el documento de registro (VRD1).","Photos of everything":"Fotos de todo","Every finding photographed and included in your report.":"Cada hallazgo se fotografía y se incluye en tu informe.","What you get":"Qué recibes","A clear report on your phone, usually the same day. This is what one looks like.":"Un informe claro en tu móvil, normalmente el mismo día. Así es uno.","SVR Car Check report":"Informe SVR Car Check","Example 5-door hatchback · Registration: SAMPLE":"Ejemplo: utilitario de 5 puertas · Matrícula: EJEMPLO","Sample report, not a real vehicle":"Informe de ejemplo, no es un vehículo real","Repaired, structurally sound":"Reparado, estructuralmente sano","Two panels have been worked on. Fair to buy at the right price.":"Dos paneles han sido trabajados. Una compra razonable al precio adecuado.","Rear right quarter: filler likely":"Aleta trasera derecha: posible masilla","Reading of 610 µm. Previous dent repaired with filler and repainted. Ask the seller about it.":"Lectura de 610 µm. Una abolladura anterior fue reparada con masilla y repintada. Pregunta al vendedor.","Check":"Revisar","Front right door: repainted":"Puerta delantera derecha: repintada","Reading of 342 µm. Good quality respray, colour match is close.":"Lectura de 342 µm. Repintado de buena calidad, el color es muy parecido.","Minor":"Leve","Sills and arches: light surface rust only":"Umbrales y pasos de rueda: solo óxido superficial leve","Typical for a coastal car. Treat within a year.":"Típico de un coche de costa. Tratar en el plazo de un año.","VIN matches the registration document":"El VIN coincide con el documento de registro","Chassis and windscreen VIN agree with the VRD1.":"El VIN del chasis y del parabrisas coincide con el VRD1.","Photo: rear quarter":"Foto: aleta trasera","Photo: door edge":"Foto: borde de la puerta","Photo: sill":"Foto: umbral","Illustration of the report format. Readings and findings are examples, not data about any real car.":"Ilustración del formato del informe. Las lecturas y los hallazgos son ejemplos, no datos de ningún coche real.","How it works":"Cómo funciona","Book":"Reservas","Send the registration and where the car is. We confirm a time with you and the seller.":"Envías la matrícula y dónde está el coche. Acordamos una hora contigo y con el vendedor.","We inspect":"Inspeccionamos","At the seller’s or at our workshop. You are welcome to come along.":"En casa del vendedor o en nuestro taller. Eres bienvenido a venir.","You decide":"Decides tú","Your report arrives on WhatsApp, with photos and our honest view.":"Tu informe llega por WhatsApp, con fotos y nuestra opinión honesta.","Prices":"Precios","[Prices and inclusions to be set by SVR.]":"[Precios y contenido por definir por SVR.]","Bodywork Check":"Revisión de carrocería","Panel gaps and accident signs":"Holguras de paneles y señales de accidente","Photo report on WhatsApp":"Informe con fotos por WhatsApp","Full Car Check":"Car Check completo","Everything in the Bodywork Check":"Todo lo de la Revisión de carrocería","Rust and underside inspection":"Inspección de óxido y de los bajos","VIN and paperwork check":"Comprobación de VIN y papeles","Written grade and buying advice":"Nota por escrito y consejos de compra","What a Car Check cannot tell you":"Lo que un Car Check no puede decirte","Outstanding finance or past ownership. Ask the seller for the VRD1 and receipts.":"Deudas pendientes o propietarios anteriores. Pide al vendedor el VRD1 y las facturas.","Mileage history. Service records are your best guide.":"Historial de kilometraje. Los registros de mantenimiento son tu mejor guía.","Mechanical faults. For engine and gearbox, ask a mechanic too.":"Fallos mecánicos. Para motor y caja de cambios, consulta también a un mecánico.","If the car was previously registered in the UK, an online history check on its old UK registration can add finance and write-off records.":"Si el coche estuvo antes matriculado en el Reino Unido, una comprobación en línea con su antigua matrícula británica puede añadir registros de deudas y siniestros totales.","Questions":"Preguntas","Does the seller need to agree?":"¿Tiene que estar de acuerdo el vendedor?","Yes. Most honest sellers are happy to. If a seller refuses an independent check, that tells you something too.":"Sí. La mayoría de los vendedores honestos aceptan. Si un vendedor rechaza una revisión independiente, eso también te dice algo.","Can you check a car outside Jersey?":"¿Pueden revisar un coche fuera de Jersey?","[Confirm with SVR. For example, Jersey only.]":"[Confirmar con SVR. Por ejemplo, solo en Jersey.]","Will you repair what you find?":"¿Repararán lo que encuentren?","Only if you ask. The report is independent, and you are free to get repairs done anywhere.":"Solo si lo pides. El informe es independiente y eres libre de reparar donde quieras.","SVR Car Check is a service of SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, Jersey.":"SVR Car Check es un servicio de SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, Jersey.","Back to SVR":"Volver a SVR","Interactive sample panel map":"Mapa interactivo de paneles de ejemplo","Car seen from above, front at the top":"Coche visto desde arriba, con el frente arriba","ES":"EN","See all services":"Ver todos los servicios","Jersey J registrations may not be covered":"Las matrículas J de Jersey pueden no estar cubiertas","Change language":"Cambiar idioma","Our services":"Nuestros servicios","SVR Services":"Servicios SVR","MOCKUP: example photos and text. Prices and times in [ ] to be confirmed with SVR.":"MAQUETA: fotos y texto de ejemplo. Precios y plazos entre [ ] por confirmar con SVR.","Every repair, done properly.":"Cada reparación, bien hecha.","From a single scratch to a full respray, here is what we do, how long it usually takes, and what to expect. Not sure which one you need? Send us a photo.":"Desde un solo arañazo hasta un repintado completo: esto es lo que hacemos, cuánto suele tardar y qué esperar. ¿No sabes cuál necesitas? Envíanos una foto.","Scratches":"Arañazos","Dents":"Abolladuras","Bumpers":"Parachoques","Respray":"Repintado","Scratch and scuff repair":"Reparación de arañazos y roces","Hedge scrapes, car-park knocks and key marks. If the scratch has not gone through to the metal, it can often be repaired without painting the whole panel.":"Roces con setos, golpes de aparcamiento y marcas de llave. Si el arañazo no ha llegado al metal, a menudo se repara sin pintar todo el panel.","Usual time":"Plazo habitual","[1 to 2 days]":"[1 a 2 días]","Price":"Precio","Best for":"Ideal para","Light to medium scratches":"Arañazos leves o medios","Get an estimate":"Pide un presupuesto","Where the paint is unbroken, we can often push the dent out from behind with no filler and no respray. Where it is not, we repair the panel properly and repaint it.":"Si la pintura está intacta, a menudo empujamos la abolladura desde atrás, sin masilla ni repintado. Si no, reparamos bien el panel y lo repintamos.","[Same day to 2 days]":"[El mismo día a 2 días]","Car-park dings, hail, small dents":"Golpes de aparcamiento, granizo, abolladuras pequeñas","Bumper repair":"Reparación de parachoques","Cracks, scrapes and splits are repaired, primed and painted to match the rest of the car. If a bumper is beyond saving, we tell you before replacing it.":"Las grietas, roces y roturas se reparan, imprimen y pintan para igualar el resto del coche. Si un parachoques no tiene arreglo, te lo decimos antes de cambiarlo.","[2 to 3 days]":"[2 a 3 días]","Parking scrapes, minor impacts":"Roces al aparcar, impactos leves","Full and part respray":"Repintado completo y parcial","Faded, peeling or damaged paint brought back. We match your paint code, test it on a spray-out card, and blend into the next panel so there is no visible join. Everything is cured in the booth.":"Recuperamos la pintura desvanecida, descascarada o dañada. Igualamos tu código de pintura, probamos en una tarjeta y fundimos con el panel de al lado para que no se vea la unión. Todo se cura en cabina.","[Part: 2 to 4 days. Full: 1 to 2 weeks]":"[Parcial: 2 a 4 días. Completo: 1 a 2 semanas]","Faded or damaged paint, colour changes":"Pintura desvanecida o dañada, cambios de color","Panels, doors, wings and the work behind them, repaired and finished to a safe standard. If it was not your fault, we can deal with the other driver’s insurer for you. [Confirm.]":"Paneles, puertas, aletas y el trabajo que hay detrás, reparados y terminados a un nivel seguro. Si no fue tu culpa, podemos tratar con la aseguradora del otro conductor por ti. [Confirmar.]","[Depends on damage and parts]":"[Depende del daño y de las piezas]","Free written estimate":"Presupuesto escrito gratis","Collision damage, insurance work":"Daños por colisión, trabajos de seguros","Not your fault? Read this":"¿No fue tu culpa? Lee esto","Alloy wheel refurbishment":"Renovación de llantas de aleación","Kerb damage, flaking lacquer and worn finishes made good, so the wheels match the rest of the car again. [Confirm that SVR offers this.]":"Daños de bordillo, barniz que se descascara y acabados gastados, reparados para que las llantas vuelvan a combinar con el coche. [Confirmar que SVR ofrece esto.]","From [£000] per wheel":"Desde [£000] por llanta","Kerb rash, peeling lacquer":"Roces de bordillo, barniz descascarado","Polishing and paint correction":"Pulido y corrección de pintura","Swirl marks, faded lacquer and light scratches removed by machine, with no paint added. The gloss comes back, and so does the depth of colour.":"Marcas circulares, barniz apagado y arañazos leves eliminados a máquina, sin añadir pintura. Vuelve el brillo, y también la profundidad del color.","[1 day]":"[1 día]","Dull or swirled paint":"Pintura opaca o con marcas circulares","Questions about repairs":"Preguntas sobre reparaciones","How do I know which repair I need?":"¿Cómo sé qué reparación necesito?","Send us photos or call in. We will tell you plainly, and if a smaller repair will do, we will say so.":"Envíanos fotos o pásate por el taller. Te lo diremos con claridad y, si basta una reparación menor, te lo diremos.","Will the repaired panel match the rest of the car?":"¿El panel reparado combinará con el resto del coche?","We match your paint code, test on a card and blend into the next panel. Paint fades over time, so we match what is on your car now.":"Igualamos tu código de pintura, probamos en una tarjeta y fundimos con el panel de al lado. La pintura se desvanece con el tiempo, así que igualamos lo que tiene tu coche ahora.","Do you work with insurers?":"¿Trabajan con aseguradoras?","[Confirm.] Yes. For a claim that was not your fault, we send the photos and estimate to the insurer.":"[Confirmar.] Sí. En un siniestro que no fue tu culpa, enviamos las fotos y el presupuesto a la aseguradora.","Is the estimate free?":"¿El presupuesto es gratis?","Yes, with no obligation.":"Sí, sin compromiso.","Not sure what you need?":"¿No sabes qué necesitas?","Send us a photo on WhatsApp. We usually reply within [one working day].":"Envíanos una foto por WhatsApp. Solemos responder en [un día laborable].","Use the estimate form":"Usa el formulario de presupuesto","Spray gun painting car panels":"Pistola de pintura pintando paneles de coche","Technician removing a dent from a door":"Técnico quitando una abolladura de una puerta","Technician spraying a car bumper":"Técnico pintando un parachoques","Car bodyshell in a spray booth":"Carrocería de coche en una cabina de pintura","Painter spraying a stripped car in the booth":"Pintor pintando un coche desmontado en la cabina","Technician polishing a car panel":"Técnico puliendo un panel de coche","Sample reading":"Lectura de ejemplo","Plastic":"Plástico","Bumpers are plastic, so we inspect them visually.":"Los parachoques son de plástico, así que los revisamos a simple vista.","Within the normal range for factory paint.":"Dentro del rango normal de la pintura de fábrica.","Thicker than factory: this panel has been resprayed.":"Más gruesa que la de fábrica: este panel ha sido repintado.","Very thick: body filler is likely under the paint.":"Muy gruesa: probablemente hay masilla bajo la pintura.","Front bumper":"Parachoques delantero","Boot lid":"Maletero","Rear bumper":"Parachoques trasero","Front left wing":"Aleta delantera izquierda","Front left door":"Puerta delantera izquierda","Rear left door":"Puerta trasera izquierda","Rear left quarter":"Aleta trasera izquierda","Front right wing":"Aleta delantera derecha","Front right door":"Puerta delantera derecha","Rear right door":"Puerta trasera derecha","Rear right quarter":"Aleta trasera derecha","Factory paint.":"Pintura de fábrica.","Repainted.":"Repintado.","Filler likely.":"Posible masilla.","Photos of the damage (optional)":"Fotos del daño (opcional)","Add photos":"Añadir fotos","Up to 5 photos. They are not uploaded to this website: they only leave your phone through WhatsApp.":"Hasta 5 fotos. No se suben a esta web: solo salen de tu teléfono por WhatsApp.","You can add up to 5 photos.":"Puedes añadir hasta 5 fotos.","Remove photo":"Quitar foto","Photo of the damage":"Foto del daño","Shared. Make sure you pressed send in WhatsApp.":"Compartido. Comprueba que pulsaste enviar en WhatsApp.","Email cannot attach photos from this page. Please add them in your email app.":"El correo no puede adjuntar fotos desde esta página. Añádelas en tu aplicación de correo.","Only what you send us: your name, phone number, registration, car details, a description of the damage and any photos. Photos stay on your device until you send them by WhatsApp. This website does not upload or store them.":"Solo lo que nos envías: tu nombre, teléfono, matrícula, datos del coche, una descripción del daño y las fotos que adjuntes. Las fotos se quedan en tu teléfono hasta que las envías por WhatsApp. Esta web no las sube ni las guarda.","Open menu":"Abrir menú","Close menu":"Cerrar menú","Language":"Idioma","Home":"Inicio","Skip to content":"Saltar al contenido","Car body repair & paint · Jersey":"Chapa y pintura de coches · Jersey","Written guarantee":"Garantía por escrito","Also:":"También:","Rust and underseal":"Óxido y protección inferior","Paint protection":"Protección de pintura","Fleet and trade":"Flotas y profesionales","Rust":"Óxido","Protection":"Protección","Fleet":"Flotas","Rust repair and underseal":"Reparación de óxido y protección inferior","After a crash? Do these four things first.":"¿Has tenido un golpe? Haz primero estas cuatro cosas.","It is stressful. This is the short version, whether you claim or pay yourself.":"Es estresante. Esta es la versión corta, tanto si reclamas al seguro como si pagas tú.","Check everyone is safe":"Comprueba que todos estén bien","Move to a safe place if you can. Call 999 if anyone is hurt or the road is blocked.":"Muévete a un lugar seguro si puedes. Llama al 999 si alguien está herido o la vía está bloqueada.","Photograph everything":"Fotografía todo","Both cars, the damage close up, the number plates and the position on the road.":"Los dos coches, el daño de cerca, las matrículas y la posición en la vía.","Swap details":"Intercambia datos","Name, phone, insurer and registration for every driver. Note any witnesses.":"Nombre, teléfono, aseguradora y matrícula de cada conductor. Anota los testigos.","Send us the photos":"Envíanos las fotos","We will tell you what needs doing and whether you can choose your own repairer.":"Te diremos qué hay que hacer y si puedes elegir tu propio taller.","General guidance, not legal or insurance advice. Always check your policy. If anyone is hurt, call 999 first.":"Orientación general, no es asesoramiento legal ni de seguros. Revisa siempre tu póliza. Si alguien está herido, llama primero al 999.","Send photos on WhatsApp":"Envía fotos por WhatsApp","Vans, company cars and small fleets":"Furgonetas, coches de empresa y pequeñas flotas","One contact for bodywork and paint across your vans, company cars or small fleet. Planned around your schedule, with one clear estimate per vehicle. [Confirm with SVR.]":"Un solo contacto para chapa y pintura de tus furgonetas, coches de empresa o pequeña flota. Trabajo planificado a tu ritmo, con un presupuesto claro por vehículo. [Confirmar con SVR.]","Ask about fleet work":"Pregunta por trabajos de flota","Do you offer a courtesy car, collection or delivery?":"¿Ofrecen coche de sustitución, recogida o entrega?","[Confirm availability.] Ask when you book. If we cannot lend you a car, we will tell you before you leave yours with us.":"[Confirmar disponibilidad.] Pregunta al reservar. Si no podemos prestarte un coche, te lo diremos antes de que dejes el tuyo.","Do you repair rust and underseal?":"¿Reparan el óxido y el protector inferior?","Yes. Jersey salt air is hard on sills, arches and the underside. We cut out rust properly and can renew underseal. [Confirm the exact treatment SVR offers.]":"Sí. El aire salado de Jersey castiga los bajos, los pasos de rueda y los estribos. Cortamos el óxido como es debido y podemos renovar el protector inferior. [Confirmar el tratamiento exacto que ofrece SVR.]","Do you work on hybrids and electric cars?":"¿Trabajan con coches híbridos y eléctricos?","[Confirm with SVR.] We work on all makes and models. For high-voltage work, we would use a qualified specialist and tell you before we start.":"[Confirmar con SVR.] Trabajamos con todas las marcas y modelos. Para trabajos de alta tensión, recurriríamos a un especialista cualificado y te lo diríamos antes de empezar.","Can you recalibrate driver aids after a repair?":"¿Pueden recalibrar las ayudas a la conducción tras una reparación?","[Confirm with SVR.] Cars with cameras and radar behind the glass or bumper often need recalibration after a repair. We can arrange it with a local specialist.":"[Confirmar con SVR.] Los coches con cámaras y radar tras el cristal o el parachoques suelen necesitar recalibración después de una reparación. Podemos coordinarlo con un especialista local.","How do I pay?":"¿Cómo puedo pagar?","[Confirm accepted payment methods.] We give you a written estimate first, and an invoice when the car is ready.":"[Confirmar medios de pago.] Primero te damos un presupuesto por escrito, y una factura cuando el coche está listo.","What to send":"Qué enviar","Your registration and the car model":"Tu matrícula y el modelo del coche","Three photos: both sides, a close-up of the damage, and the whole car":"Tres fotos: los dos lados, una foto de cerca del daño y el coche completo","What happened, and your preferred drop-off day":"Qué pasó y el día que prefieres dejarlo","Preferred drop-off day (optional)":"Día preferido para dejarlo (opcional)","Cookies":"Cookies","This website does not set cookies and does not load fonts or images from third parties. Everything it needs is served from this site.":"Este sitio no usa cookies ni carga fuentes o imágenes de terceros. Todo lo que necesita se sirve desde este mismo sitio.","Accessibility":"Accesibilidad","We aim to meet WCAG 2.2 AA: readable contrast, keyboard navigation, visible focus, large touch targets and support for reduced motion. If something is hard to use, call us and we will help.":"Queremos cumplir WCAG 2.2 AA: contraste legible, navegación con teclado, foco visible, botones grandes y respeto por la reducción de movimiento. Si algo te resulta difícil de usar, llámanos y te ayudamos.","SVR painter spraying a car panel in the spray booth":"Pintor de SVR aplicando pintura a un panel en la cabina","Salt air and wet lanes find every sill, arch and seam. We cut out the rust, treat the metal, repair the panel and renew the underseal so it does not come straight back. [Confirm the exact treatment SVR offers.]":"El aire salado y las vías mojadas llegan a cada estribo, paso de rueda y junta. Cortamos el óxido, tratamos el metal, reparamos el panel y renovamos el protector inferior para que no vuelva enseguida. [Confirmar el tratamiento exacto que ofrece SVR.]","[2 to 5 days]":"[2 a 5 días]","Sills, arches, boot floors":"Estribos, pasos de rueda, piso del maletero","Fresh paint needs looking after. A wax, sealant or ceramic coating helps it stay glossy and makes salt, bird lime and tar easier to wash off. [Confirm which products SVR uses.]":"La pintura nueva necesita cuidados. Una cera, sellador o recubrimiento cerámico ayuda a mantener el brillo y hace que la sal, los excrementos de pájaro y el alquitrán se laven mejor. [Confirmar qué productos usa SVR.]","New paint, dark colours":"Pintura nueva, colores oscuros","Panels, doors, wings and the work behind them, repaired and finished to a safe standard. If it was not your fault, we can deal with the other driver’s insurer for you. [Confirm.] If the car has cameras or radar, we arrange recalibration after the repair. [Confirm.]":"Paneles, puertas, aletas y el trabajo que hay detrás, reparados y acabados con seguridad. Si no fue culpa tuya, podemos tratar con la aseguradora del otro conductor. [Confirmar.] Si el coche tiene cámaras o radar, coordinamos la recalibración después de la reparación. [Confirmar.]","Vans, company cars or a small fleet: one contact, one clear estimate per vehicle, and work planned around your schedule. [Confirm with SVR.]":"Furgonetas, coches de empresa o una pequeña flota: un solo contacto, un presupuesto claro por vehículo y trabajo planificado a tu ritmo. [Confirmar con SVR.]","Car in the workshop being checked underneath":"Coche en el taller revisado por debajo","Technician applying protection to a painted panel":"Técnico aplicando protección a un panel pintado","Do you scan the car before and after a repair?":"¿Hacen un diagnóstico antes y después de la reparación?","[Confirm with SVR.] Modern cars have sensors and computers. If a scan is needed, we arrange it with a local specialist and include it in the estimate.":"[Confirmar con SVR.] Los coches modernos tienen sensores y ordenadores. Si hace falta un diagnóstico, lo coordinamos con un especialista local y lo incluimos en el presupuesto.","How should I look after fresh paint?":"¿Cómo debo cuidar la pintura nueva?","Avoid washing the car for [confirm: about a week], and no wax or polish for [confirm: about a month]. We give you written aftercare when you collect.":"No laves el coche durante [confirmar: aproximadamente una semana] y no apliques cera ni pulimento durante [confirmar: aproximadamente un mes]. Te damos instrucciones escritas de cuidado al recogerlo.","What if something is not right after the repair?":"¿Y si algo no queda bien después de la reparación?","Tell us straight away. We will look at it and put it right. [Confirm the process.]":"Dínoslo enseguida. Lo revisaremos y lo arreglaremos. [Confirmar el proceso.]","MOCKUP: example photos. [ ] = real workshop details to come.":"MAQUETA: fotos de ejemplo. [ ] = datos reales del taller por llegar.","Car body repair and paint in Jersey for dents, scratches and accident damage. Colour-matched to your paint code, finished so the repair disappears, and guaranteed in writing.":"Reparación de carrocería y pintura en Jersey para abolladuras, arañazos y daños por accidente. Color igualado a tu código de pintura, acabado para que la reparación no se note y con garantía por escrito.","Colour-matched to your paint code":"Color igualado a tu código de pintura","Prepared, primed and painted in a controlled booth, then we deal with your insurer if you wish.":"Preparado, imprimado y pintado en cabina controlada; si quieres, nos encargamos del seguro.","Both cars, a close-up of the damage, the number plates and the position on the road.":"Los dos coches, una foto de cerca del daño, las matrículas y la posición en la vía.","Demo effect on a stock photo. Replace with the workshop’s own before-and-after photos, with each owner’s permission.":"Efecto de demostración sobre una foto de banco de imágenes. Sustituir por fotos de antes y después del propio taller, con permiso de cada propietario.","A history report can show outstanding finance, past write-offs and mileage records from UK databases.":"Un informe de historial puede mostrar deudas pendientes, siniestros totales anteriores y registros de kilometraje de bases de datos del Reino Unido.","Every panel is checked in bright light before we call you.":"Cada panel se comprueba con luz intensa antes de llamarte.","Fresh jobs from the spray booth, before-and-after photos, and the odd classic. Follow SVR on Instagram.":"Trabajos recién salidos de la cabina, fotos de antes y después, y algún clásico. Sigue a SVR en Instagram.","Can you recalibrate driver-assistance systems after a repair?":"¿Pueden recalibrar los sistemas de ayuda a la conducción tras una reparación?","[Confirm with SVR.] Cars with cameras and radar behind the windscreen or bumper often need recalibration after a repair. We can arrange it with a local specialist.":"[Confirmar con SVR.] Los coches con cámaras y radar tras el parabrisas o el parachoques suelen necesitar recalibración después de una reparación. Podemos coordinarlo con un especialista local.","Do not wash the car for [confirm: about a week], and do not wax or polish it for [confirm: about a month]. We give you written aftercare when you collect.":"No laves el coche durante [confirmar: aproximadamente una semana] y no le apliques cera ni pulimento durante [confirmar: aproximadamente un mes]. Te damos instrucciones escritas de cuidado al recogerlo.","Your registration and the car’s make and model":"Tu matrícula y la marca y el modelo del coche","Book your appointment now @svrje2023":"Reserva tu cita ahora @svrje2023","Jersey, Channel Islands":"Jersey, Islas del Canal","Mockup: example photos. [ ] = real workshop details to come.":"Maqueta: fotos de ejemplo. [ ] = datos reales del taller por llegar.","Mockup: example photos and text. Prices and times in [ ] to be confirmed with SVR.":"Maqueta: fotos y texto de ejemplo. Precios y plazos entre [ ] por confirmar con SVR.","Mockup: concept page. Sample report only, not a real vehicle. [ ] = to confirm with SVR.":"Maqueta: página conceptual. Solo informe de ejemplo, no es un vehículo real. [ ] = por confirmar con SVR.","Car Body Repair & Paint in Jersey | SVR Sienna Vehicle Refinishing":"Chapa y pintura de coches en Jersey | SVR Sienna Vehicle Refinishing","Car Body Repair Services in Jersey | SVR":"Servicios de chapa y pintura en Jersey | SVR","Used Car Bodywork Check in Jersey | SVR Car Check":"Revisión de carrocería de coches usados en Jersey | SVR Car Check","Hello SVR, I would like a free estimate.":"Hola SVR, quiero un presupuesto gratis.","Registration":"Matrícula","Car":"Coche","Name":"Nombre","What happened":"Qué pasó","Preferred drop-off":"Día preferido para dejarlo","Estimate request":"Solicitud de presupuesto","Pre-purchase bodywork inspection for a car I am thinking of buying.":"Revisión de carrocería antes de comprar un coche."},"pt":{"MOCKUP: free-licence example photos. [ ] = real workshop details to come.":"MAQUETE: fotos de exemplo com licença livre. [ ] = dados reais da oficina por chegar.","Services":"Serviços","Process":"Processo","Standards":"Padrões","Reviews":"Opiniões","Contact":"Contacto","Flawless":"Acabamento","finish.":"impecável.","Every panel.":"Em cada painel.","Refined over 20 years. Finished to perfection.":"Mais de 20 anos de ofício. Acabamento perfeito.","Car body repair and paint in Jersey, for dents, scratches and accident damage. Colour matched to your paint code, finished so you cannot find the repair, and guaranteed in writing.":"Reparação de chapa e pintura em Jersey: amolgadelas, riscos e danos de acidente. Cor igualada ao código de tinta do seu carro, tão bem acabada que a reparação não se nota, e com garantia por escrito.","Get a free estimate":"Peça orçamento grátis","WhatsApp your photos":"Envie as fotos por WhatsApp","Call [01534 000000]":"Ligue para [01534 000000]","Scratch repair":"Reparação de riscos","Dent removal":"Remoção de amolgadelas","Full respray":"Pintura total","Accident repair":"Reparação de acidentes","Colour matching":"Igualação de cor","Alloy wheels":"Jantes de liga leve","Polishing":"Polimento","Whatever happened to your car":"Seja o que for que aconteceu ao seu carro","Send us a photo and we will tell you plainly what it needs. Sometimes that is a small repair, not a respray.":"Envie-nos uma foto e dizemos-lhe com clareza o que precisa. Às vezes é uma reparação pequena, não uma pintura completa.","Dents without the respray":"Amolgadelas sem repintar","Paintless dent removal where the paint is unbroken. Panel work where it is not.":"Remoção de amolgadelas sem pintura quando a tinta está intacta. Se não estiver, tratamos o painel.","From [£000]":"Desde [£000]","Accident and bumper repair":"Reparação de acidentes e para-choques","Prepared, primed and painted in a controlled booth, then handled with your insurer if you wish.":"Preparado, aplicado primário e pintado numa cabine controlada, e, se quiser, tratamos nós da seguradora.","Free estimate":"Orçamento grátis","Polish and protect":"Polir e proteger","Swirl marks, faded lacquer and light scratches brought back to a mirror shine.":"Marcas circulares, verniz baço e riscos leves recuperam um brilho de espelho.","[Confirm with the workshop which services it really offers, and prices.]":"[Confirmar com a oficina que serviços oferece realmente e os preços.]","Not your fault? We deal with the insurer.":"Não foi culpa sua? Tratamos nós da seguradora.","If someone else caused the damage, you should not have to chase anyone. We send the photos and the estimate to the insurers, handle the back and forth, and keep you updated until your car is home.":"Se outra pessoa causou o dano, não deve ter de andar atrás de ninguém. Enviamos as fotos e o orçamento às seguradoras, tratamos de toda a troca de informação e mantemo-lo informado até o carro estar em casa.","In most cases you can choose who repairs your car":"Na maioria dos casos pode escolher quem repara o seu carro","Photos and a written estimate sent straight to the insurer":"Fotos e orçamento por escrito enviados diretamente à seguradora","Updates by WhatsApp until the job is done":"Novidades por WhatsApp até o trabalho estar concluído","Tell us what happened":"Conte-nos o que aconteceu","[Confirm SVR offers insurance claims handling, and check the wording with a Jersey insurer.]":"[Confirmar que a SVR trata de processos de seguros e rever o texto com uma seguradora de Jersey.]","How your car comes back perfect":"Assim volta o seu carro perfeito","Scroll to follow a repair from the first look to the keys in your hand.":"Desça para acompanhar uma reparação, desde a primeira avaliação até ter as chaves na mão.","Step 1":"Passo 1","We look, you get a price":"Avaliamos e damos-lhe um preço","Send photos or drop in. You receive a clear written estimate, usually within [one working day], with no obligation.":"Envie fotos ou passe pela oficina. Recebe um orçamento claro por escrito, normalmente em [um dia útil], sem compromisso.","Step 2":"Passo 2","Strip back and repair":"Desmontar e reparar","Dents are pulled, rust is cut out, and the panel is prepared properly. This is where most of a good finish is won.":"Tiram-se as amolgadelas, corta-se a ferrugem e prepara-se bem o painel. É aqui que se ganha a maior parte de um bom acabamento.","Step 3":"Passo 3","Your exact colour":"A sua cor exata","Mixed to your paint code and tested on a spray-out card beside the car, then blended into the next panel.":"Mistura-se com o código de tinta do seu carro e testa-se num cartão junto ao carro; depois funde-se com o painel ao lado.","Step 4":"Passo 4","Baked in the booth":"Cozido na cabine","Dust-free spraying, then heat curing for a hard, glossy lacquer that lasts.":"Pintura sem pó e cura com calor para um verniz duro, brilhante e duradouro.","Step 5":"Passo 5","Polished by hand and machine":"Polido à mão e à máquina","Every panel is checked in bright light and polished until the repair disappears.":"Cada painel é verificado com luz forte e polido até a reparação desaparecer.","Step 6":"Passo 6","Collect it, guaranteed":"Levante-o, com garantia","Cleaned inside and out, with a written guarantee. [Guarantee terms to confirm.]":"Limpo por dentro e por fora, com garantia por escrito. [Condições da garantia por confirmar.]","Before":"Antes","After":"Depois","Demo effect on a stock photo. Replace with the workshop’s own before and after photos, with each owner’s permission.":"Efeito de demonstração sobre uma foto de banco de imagens. Substituir por fotos de antes e depois da própria oficina, com autorização de cada dono.","See the difference":"Veja a diferença","Drag across the car. Our job is to make the repair impossible to find: same colour, same gloss, same finish as the factory.":"Arraste sobre o carro. O nosso trabalho é tornar a reparação impossível de encontrar: mesma cor, mesmo brilho, mesmo acabamento de fábrica.","Get yours looked at":"Peça uma avaliação","Buying a used car? Check it first.":"Vai comprar um carro usado? Verifique-o primeiro.","A clean history does not mean a clean car. Hidden repairs, filler and resprays only show up when someone measures the paint.":"Um historial limpo não significa um carro limpo. Reparações escondidas, betume e repinturas só se descobrem quando alguém mede a tinta.","Pre-purchase bodywork inspection":"Inspeção de chapa antes da compra","Before you buy, we check every panel with a paint thickness gauge and inspect the car in bright light. You get a short written report with photos, so you know exactly what you are paying for.":"Antes de comprar, verificamos cada painel com um medidor de espessura de tinta e inspecionamos o carro com luz forte. Recebe um relatório curto por escrito com fotos, para saber exatamente o que está a pagar.","[Price to confirm with SVR]":"[Preço por confirmar com a SVR]","Example reading, for illustration":"Leitura de exemplo, apenas ilustrativa","paint depth (µm)":"espessura da tinta (µm)","Bonnet":"Capô","Front wing":"Guarda-lamas dianteiro","Front door":"Porta dianteira","Rear door":"Porta traseira","Roof":"Tejadilho","A much thicker reading on one panel usually means it has been repainted.":"Uma leitura muito mais grossa num painel costuma indicar que foi repintado.","Book an inspection":"Marcar uma inspeção","See SVR Car Check":"Ver SVR Car Check","Online history check":"Verificação de historial online","A history report can show outstanding finance, past write-offs and mileage records, from UK databases.":"Um relatório de historial pode mostrar financiamento em dívida, perdas totais anteriores e registos de quilometragem, a partir de bases de dados do Reino Unido.","Best for cars with a previous UK registration":"Ideal para carros com matrícula anterior do Reino Unido","Paid service, run by a third party":"Serviço pago, prestado por terceiros","Check a history online":"Consultar o historial online","Opens carVertical, an independent website. SVR is not responsible for its reports. [Confirm which provider SVR wants to recommend.]":"Abre o carVertical, um site independente. A SVR não é responsável pelos seus relatórios. [Confirmar que fornecedor a SVR quer recomendar.]","Our standards":"Os nossos padrões","You expect a repair you cannot spot, and a workshop that keeps its word. This is what we commit to on every job.":"Espera uma reparação que não se veja e uma oficina que cumpre a palavra. É isto que garantimos em cada trabalho.","A written, itemised estimate":"Orçamento detalhado por escrito","The price is agreed before any work starts. If anything changes, we ask you first.":"O preço fica acordado antes de começar qualquer trabalho. Se algo mudar, perguntamos-lhe primeiro.","Colour matched to your paint code":"Cor igualada ao código de tinta","Checked on a spray-out card in daylight and blended into the neighbouring panel.":"Verificada num cartão à luz do dia e fundida com o painel vizinho.","Progress updates":"Atualizações do trabalho","Photos and a message at each stage, by WhatsApp or phone. [To confirm.]":"Fotos e uma mensagem em cada fase, por WhatsApp ou telefone. [A confirmar.]","Honest advice":"Conselho honesto","If a smaller repair will do, we will tell you, even when it costs us the bigger job.":"Se uma reparação menor chegar, dizemos-lho, mesmo que nos custe o trabalho maior.","Inspected before handover":"Inspecionado antes da entrega","Every panel is checked under bright light before we call you.":"Cada painel é verificado com luz forte antes de lhe ligarmos.","Guaranteed in writing":"Garantia por escrito","[Guarantee terms to confirm with SVR.]":"[Condições da garantia a confirmar com a SVR.]","[Insurer approvals, if held]":"[Aprovações de seguradoras, se existirem]","[Trade body membership, if held]":"[Filiação em associação do setor, se existir]","[Manufacturer paint system, if used]":"[Sistema de tinta do fabricante, se for usado]","Only show an accreditation once SVR can prove it. Better a short, true list than a long one.":"Só mostrar uma acreditação quando a SVR a puder comprovar. Mais vale uma lista curta e verdadeira do que uma longa.","years of experience":"anos de experiência","vehicles repaired [to confirm]":"veículos reparados [a confirmar]","average Google rating [to confirm]":"classificação média no Google [a confirmar]","parishes covered":"paróquias abrangidas","Made for Jersey roads":"Feito para as estradas de Jersey","Narrow lanes, hedges, coastal car parks and salt in the air. We see the same problems all year, and we know how to fix them.":"Ruas estreitas, sebes, parques à beira-mar e sal no ar. Vemos os mesmos problemas todo o ano e sabemos como os resolver.","Hedge scrapes":"Riscos de sebes","Fine scratches along one side. Often polish out; deeper ones need paint.":"Riscos finos ao longo de um lado. Muitas vezes saem com polimento; os mais fundos precisam de tinta.","Salt-air rust":"Ferrugem do ar salgado","Small bubbles near wheel arches and sills. Fix them early, before they spread.":"Pequenas bolhas junto às cavas das rodas e soleiras. Trate-as cedo, antes que se espalhem.","Car-park dings":"Pancadas de estacionamento","Shallow dents with unbroken paint can often be pushed out without a respray.":"Amolgadelas superficiais com a tinta intacta costumam poder sair sem repintar.","20+ years. Run by the people who do the work":"Mais de 20 anos. Dirigida por quem faz o trabalho","SVR (Sienna Vehicle Refinishing) is owned and run by Guillermo Goveia and Gabriel Das Neves. When you bring your car in, you deal with them directly, from the estimate to the final check.":"A SVR (Sienna Vehicle Refinishing) é propriedade de Guillermo Goveia e Gabriel Das Neves, que a dirigem. Quando traz o carro, trata diretamente com eles, do orçamento à verificação final.","[Add a short line about their background, and a photo of both if they agree.]":"[Acrescentar uma breve linha sobre o percurso deles e uma foto de ambos, se concordarem.]","See the work as it happens":"Veja o trabalho a acontecer","Fresh jobs from the spray booth, before and afters, and the odd classic. Follow SVR on Instagram.":"Trabalhos frescos da cabine de pintura, antes e depois, e um ou outro clássico. Siga a SVR no Instagram.","Follow @svrje2023":"Siga @svrje2023","Post shown as published on SVR’s Instagram. [Swap in more posts, or a live feed, later.]":"Publicação mostrada tal como foi publicada no Instagram da SVR. [Trocar por mais publicações, ou um feed em direto, mais tarde.]","What customers say":"O que dizem os clientes","Sample wording only. Use real reviews, with permission.":"Texto apenas de exemplo. Usar opiniões reais, com autorização.","“Sample review: I couldn’t tell where the repair was. The colour match was spot on.”":"“Opinião de exemplo: não consegui perceber onde estava a reparação. A cor ficou igualzinha.”","[Customer name], St Helier":"[Nome do cliente], St Helier","“Sample review: they dealt with my insurer and kept me updated every day.”":"“Opinião de exemplo: trataram da minha seguradora e mantiveram-me informado todos os dias.”","[Customer name], St Brelade":"[Nome do cliente], St Brelade","“Sample review: fair price, honest advice, and the car came back spotless.”":"“Opinião de exemplo: preço justo, conselho honesto e o carro voltou impecável.”","[Customer name], Grouville":"[Nome do cliente], Grouville","Questions we get asked":"Perguntas frequentes","Do I have to use my insurer’s repairer?":"Tenho de usar a oficina da minha seguradora?","[Confirm for Jersey insurers.] In most cases you can choose your own repairer. Check your policy, or ask us and we will help.":"[Confirmar para as seguradoras de Jersey.] Na maioria dos casos pode escolher a sua própria oficina. Veja a sua apólice, ou pergunte-nos e ajudamos.","How long will it take?":"Quanto tempo demora?","Small repairs can take a day or two. Larger jobs depend on parts and damage. We give you a date with your estimate.":"As reparações pequenas podem demorar um ou dois dias. Os trabalhos maiores dependem das peças e do dano. Damos-lhe uma data com o orçamento.","Will the colour match?":"A cor vai ficar igual?","We use your car’s paint code, test on a spray-out card and blend into neighbouring panels. Paint fades over time, so we match what is on your car now.":"Usamos o código de tinta do seu carro, testamos num cartão e fundimos com os painéis vizinhos. A tinta desbota com o tempo, por isso igualamos o que o seu carro tem agora.","Is the estimate really free?":"O orçamento é mesmo grátis?","Yes, with no obligation. Photos give a good guide; we confirm in person.":"Sim, sem compromisso. As fotos dão uma boa ideia; confirmamos pessoalmente.","Do you offer a courtesy car?":"Têm carro de cortesia?","[Confirm availability.] Ask when you book.":"[Confirmar disponibilidade.] Pergunte ao marcar.","Fill this in and press send. WhatsApp opens with your details ready, so you can add photos of the damage in the same chat. We usually reply within [one working day].":"Preencha e carregue em enviar. O WhatsApp abre com os seus dados prontos, para poder juntar fotos do dano na mesma conversa. Normalmente respondemos em [um dia útil].","Start with your registration":"Comece pela matrícula","As shown on your Jersey number plate.":"Como aparece na matrícula de Jersey.","Car make and model":"Marca e modelo do carro","Your name":"O seu nome","Phone":"Telefone","What happened?":"O que aconteceu?","We use your details only to reply to your enquiry. See our":"Usamos os seus dados apenas para responder ao seu pedido. Veja o nosso","privacy notice":"aviso de privacidade","Send on WhatsApp":"Enviar por WhatsApp","No WhatsApp?":"Sem WhatsApp?","Send it by email instead":"Envie antes por e-mail","WhatsApp is opening with your message. Add photos of the damage in the chat, then press send.":"O WhatsApp está a abrir com a sua mensagem. Junte fotos do dano na conversa e carregue em enviar.","Find us":"Onde estamos","[Address], [Parish], Jersey [JE_ ___]":"[Morada], [Paróquia], Jersey [JE_ ___]","Monday to Friday":"Segunda a sexta","Saturday":"Sábado","Sunday":"Domingo","Closed":"Fechado","Map goes here":"O mapa vai aqui","(free OpenStreetMap)":"(OpenStreetMap gratuito)","Privacy notice":"Aviso de privacidade","Who we are":"Quem somos","SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, [address], Jersey [JE_ ___]. Contact: [email@address].":"SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, [morada], Jersey [JE_ ___]. Contacto: [email@address].","What we collect":"O que recolhemos","Why we use it":"Para que usamos","To reply to your enquiry, give you an estimate and carry out the repair. We do not sell your details or send marketing without asking first.":"Para responder ao seu pedido, dar-lhe um orçamento e fazer a reparação. Não vendemos os seus dados nem enviamos publicidade sem perguntar primeiro.","How long we keep it":"Quanto tempo guardamos","[For example, up to two years after your last job.] Then it is deleted.":"[Por exemplo, até dois anos após o último trabalho.] Depois são apagados.","Who else sees it":"Quem mais os vê","No one outside SVR, except the services you choose to contact us through. Messages sent by WhatsApp are also handled by WhatsApp (Meta).":"Ninguém fora da SVR, exceto os serviços que escolher para nos contactar. As mensagens enviadas por WhatsApp também são tratadas pelo WhatsApp (Meta).","Your rights":"Os seus direitos","You can ask to see, correct or delete your details at any time. If you are unhappy with how we use them, you can complain to the Jersey Office of the Information Commissioner.":"Pode pedir para ver, corrigir ou apagar os seus dados em qualquer momento. Se não estiver satisfeito com o uso que fazemos deles, pode apresentar queixa ao Jersey Office of the Information Commissioner.","This website does not set cookies. It loads its fonts from Google Fonts. [Check before going live.]":"Este site não usa cookies. Carrega os seus tipos de letra do Google Fonts. [Verificar antes de ir para o ar.]","[Template only. Have it checked against the Data Protection (Jersey) Law 2018 before the site goes live.]":"[Apenas modelo. Mandar verificar com a Data Protection (Jersey) Law 2018 antes de o site ir para o ar.]","© [Year] SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, Jersey. Owners: Guillermo Goveia and Gabriel Das Neves. [Company registration number].":"© [Ano] SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, Jersey. Proprietários: Guillermo Goveia e Gabriel Das Neves. [Número de registo da empresa].","Book your appointment":"Marque a sua visita","Call":"Ligar","Estimate":"Orçamento","SVR logo":"Logótipo da SVR","Main":"Principal","SVR painter spraying a red car panel in the spray booth":"Pintor da SVR a pintar um painel vermelho na cabine de pintura","Technician removing a dent from a car door panel":"Técnico a tirar uma amolgadela da porta de um carro","Technician in protective suit spraying a car bumper":"Técnico com fato de proteção a pintar um para-choques","Technician polishing a car panel with a machine":"Técnico a polir um painel de carro com uma máquina","Car before repair (demo effect)":"Carro antes da reparação (efeito de demonstração)","Car after repair":"Carro depois da reparação","Compare before and after":"Comparar antes e depois","Example paint thickness reading":"Exemplo de leitura de espessura de tinta","Accreditations":"Acreditações","Parishes we cover":"Paróquias que abrangemos","SVR painter spraying a red panel in the booth":"Pintor da SVR a pintar um painel vermelho na cabine","5 stars":"5 estrelas","e.g. Volkswagen Golf":"ex.: Volkswagen Golf","e.g. scraped the rear door in a car park":"ex.: risquei a porta traseira num parque de estacionamento","MOCKUP: concept page. Sample report only, not a real vehicle. [ ] = to confirm with SVR.":"MAQUETE: página conceito. Apenas relatório de exemplo, não é um veículo real. [ ] = a confirmar com a SVR.","← SVR home":"← Início da SVR","Know the car before you buy it.":"Conheça o carro antes de o comprar.","An independent bodywork and condition report for used cars in Jersey, carried out in person by the team at SVR.":"Um relatório independente de chapa e estado para carros usados em Jersey, feito pessoalmente pela equipa da SVR.","Registration of the car you are looking at":"Matrícula do carro que está a ver","Book a Car Check":"Marcar um Car Check","See a sample report":"Ver um relatório de exemplo","Why in person?":"Porquê pessoalmente?","Jersey has no public vehicle history database. Online checks only cover cars with a UK past. So we check what matters most: the car itself.":"Jersey não tem uma base de dados pública de historial de veículos. As verificações online só cobrem carros com passado no Reino Unido. Por isso verificamos o que mais importa: o próprio carro.","Factory paint":"Tinta de fábrica","Repainted":"Repintado","Filler likely":"Provável betume","What we check":"O que verificamos","About [45 minutes] at the seller’s address or at our workshop. [Confirm with SVR.]":"Cerca de [45 minutos] na morada do vendedor ou na nossa oficina. [Confirmar com a SVR.]","Paint depth on every panel":"Espessura da tinta em cada painel","Measured with a gauge, to find resprays and hidden repairs.":"Medida com um medidor, para encontrar repinturas e reparações escondidas.","Panel gaps and alignment":"Folgas e alinhamento dos painéis","Uneven gaps often point to an accident repair.":"Folgas irregulares apontam muitas vezes para uma reparação de acidente.","Signs of accident damage":"Sinais de dano de acidente","Overspray, replaced panels, welds and filler.":"Excesso de tinta, painéis substituídos, soldaduras e betume.","Rust from salt air":"Ferrugem do ar salgado","Sills, wheel arches and underside, where island cars suffer most.":"Soleiras, cavas das rodas e fundo, onde os carros da ilha mais sofrem.","Identity matches the paperwork":"A identidade coincide com os documentos","VIN on the car compared with the registration document (VRD1).":"O VIN do carro comparado com o documento de registo (VRD1).","Photos of everything":"Fotos de tudo","Every finding photographed and included in your report.":"Cada achado fotografado e incluído no seu relatório.","What you get":"O que recebe","A clear report on your phone, usually the same day. This is what one looks like.":"Um relatório claro no telemóvel, normalmente no mesmo dia. É assim que um relatório fica.","SVR Car Check report":"Relatório SVR Car Check","Example 5-door hatchback · Registration: SAMPLE":"Exemplo: hatchback de 5 portas · Matrícula: EXEMPLO","Sample report, not a real vehicle":"Relatório de exemplo, não é um veículo real","Repaired, structurally sound":"Reparado, estruturalmente sólido","Two panels have been worked on. Fair to buy at the right price.":"Dois painéis foram trabalhados. Aceitável para comprar ao preço certo.","Rear right quarter: filler likely":"Painel lateral traseiro direito: provável betume","Reading of 610 µm. Previous dent repaired with filler and repainted. Ask the seller about it.":"Leitura de 610 µm. Amolgadela anterior reparada com betume e repintada. Pergunte ao vendedor.","Check":"Verificar","Front right door: repainted":"Porta dianteira direita: repintada","Reading of 342 µm. Good quality respray, colour match is close.":"Leitura de 342 µm. Pintura de boa qualidade, a cor é muito próxima.","Minor":"Menor","Sills and arches: light surface rust only":"Soleiras e cavas: apenas ferrugem superficial leve","Typical for a coastal car. Treat within a year.":"Típico de um carro costeiro. Tratar no prazo de um ano.","VIN matches the registration document":"O VIN coincide com o documento de registo","Chassis and windscreen VIN agree with the VRD1.":"O VIN do chassis e do para-brisas coincide com o VRD1.","Photo: rear quarter":"Foto: painel lateral traseiro","Photo: door edge":"Foto: rebordo da porta","Photo: sill":"Foto: soleira","Illustration of the report format. Readings and findings are examples, not data about any real car.":"Ilustração do formato do relatório. As leituras e os achados são exemplos, não dados de um carro real.","How it works":"Como funciona","Book":"Marque","Send the registration and where the car is. We confirm a time with you and the seller.":"Envie a matrícula e onde está o carro. Combinamos uma hora consigo e com o vendedor.","We inspect":"Inspecionamos","At the seller’s or at our workshop. You are welcome to come along.":"Na morada do vendedor ou na nossa oficina. É bem-vindo a acompanhar.","You decide":"Você decide","Your report arrives on WhatsApp, with photos and our honest view.":"O relatório chega por WhatsApp, com fotos e a nossa opinião honesta.","Prices":"Preços","[Prices and inclusions to be set by SVR.]":"[Preços e o que incluem a definir pela SVR.]","Bodywork Check":"Verificação de chapa","Panel gaps and accident signs":"Folgas dos painéis e sinais de acidente","Photo report on WhatsApp":"Relatório fotográfico por WhatsApp","Full Car Check":"Car Check completo","Everything in the Bodywork Check":"Tudo o que inclui a Verificação de chapa","Rust and underside inspection":"Inspeção de ferrugem e fundo","VIN and paperwork check":"Verificação do VIN e dos documentos","Written grade and buying advice":"Nota por escrito e conselho de compra","What a Car Check cannot tell you":"O que um Car Check não lhe pode dizer","Outstanding finance or past ownership. Ask the seller for the VRD1 and receipts.":"Financiamento em dívida ou proprietários anteriores. Peça ao vendedor o VRD1 e as faturas.","Mileage history. Service records are your best guide.":"Historial de quilómetros. Os registos de revisões são o melhor guia.","Mechanical faults. For engine and gearbox, ask a mechanic too.":"Avarias mecânicas. Para motor e caixa de velocidades, consulte também um mecânico.","If the car was previously registered in the UK, an online history check on its old UK registration can add finance and write-off records.":"Se o carro esteve registado no Reino Unido, uma verificação online com a antiga matrícula britânica pode acrescentar registos de financiamento e de perda total.","Questions":"Perguntas","Does the seller need to agree?":"O vendedor tem de concordar?","Yes. Most honest sellers are happy to. If a seller refuses an independent check, that tells you something too.":"Sim. A maioria dos vendedores honestos aceita de bom grado. Se um vendedor recusa uma verificação independente, isso também lhe diz alguma coisa.","Can you check a car outside Jersey?":"Podem verificar um carro fora de Jersey?","[Confirm with SVR. For example, Jersey only.]":"[Confirmar com a SVR. Por exemplo, só em Jersey.]","Will you repair what you find?":"Vão reparar o que encontrarem?","Only if you ask. The report is independent, and you are free to get repairs done anywhere.":"Só se pedir. O relatório é independente e é livre de fazer as reparações onde quiser.","SVR Car Check is a service of SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, Jersey.":"O SVR Car Check é um serviço da SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, Jersey.","Back to SVR":"Voltar à SVR","Interactive sample panel map":"Mapa interativo de painéis de exemplo","Car seen from above, front at the top":"Carro visto de cima, frente no topo","ES":"ES","See all services":"Ver todos os serviços","Jersey J registrations may not be covered":"As matrículas J de Jersey podem não estar cobertas","Change language":"Mudar idioma","Our services":"Os nossos serviços","SVR Services":"Serviços SVR","MOCKUP: example photos and text. Prices and times in [ ] to be confirmed with SVR.":"MAQUETE: fotos e texto de exemplo. Preços e prazos em [ ] a confirmar com a SVR.","Every repair, done properly.":"Cada reparação, bem feita.","From a single scratch to a full respray, here is what we do, how long it usually takes, and what to expect. Not sure which one you need? Send us a photo.":"De um simples risco a uma pintura completa, eis o que fazemos, quanto costuma demorar e o que esperar. Não sabe de qual precisa? Envie-nos uma foto.","Scratches":"Riscos","Dents":"Amolgadelas","Bumpers":"Para-choques","Respray":"Pintura","Scratch and scuff repair":"Reparação de riscos e arranhões","Hedge scrapes, car-park knocks and key marks. If the scratch has not gone through to the metal, it can often be repaired without painting the whole panel.":"Riscos de sebes, pancadas em parques e marcas de chave. Se o risco não chegou ao metal, muitas vezes pode ser reparado sem pintar o painel todo.","Usual time":"Prazo habitual","[1 to 2 days]":"[1 a 2 dias]","Price":"Preço","Best for":"Ideal para","Light to medium scratches":"Riscos leves a médios","Get an estimate":"Peça um orçamento","Where the paint is unbroken, we can often push the dent out from behind with no filler and no respray. Where it is not, we repair the panel properly and repaint it.":"Onde a tinta está intacta, muitas vezes conseguimos empurrar a amolgadela por trás, sem betume e sem repintar. Onde não está, reparamos bem o painel e repintamos.","[Same day to 2 days]":"[No mesmo dia a 2 dias]","Car-park dings, hail, small dents":"Pancadas de estacionamento, granizo, amolgadelas pequenas","Bumper repair":"Reparação de para-choques","Cracks, scrapes and splits are repaired, primed and painted to match the rest of the car. If a bumper is beyond saving, we tell you before replacing it.":"Fendas, riscos e roturas são reparados, preparados e pintados para combinar com o resto do carro. Se um para-choques não tiver salvação, dizemos-lhe antes de o substituir.","[2 to 3 days]":"[2 a 3 dias]","Parking scrapes, minor impacts":"Raspões ao estacionar, impactos leves","Full and part respray":"Pintura total e parcial","Faded, peeling or damaged paint brought back. We match your paint code, test it on a spray-out card, and blend into the next panel so there is no visible join. Everything is cured in the booth.":"Pintura desbotada, a descascar ou danificada recuperada. Igualamos o código de tinta, testamos num cartão e fundimos com o painel ao lado, para não se ver a junção. Tudo é curado na cabine.","[Part: 2 to 4 days. Full: 1 to 2 weeks]":"[Parcial: 2 a 4 dias. Total: 1 a 2 semanas]","Faded or damaged paint, colour changes":"Pintura desbotada ou danificada, mudanças de cor","Panels, doors, wings and the work behind them, repaired and finished to a safe standard. If it was not your fault, we can deal with the other driver’s insurer for you. [Confirm.]":"Painéis, portas, guarda-lamas e o trabalho por trás deles, reparados e acabados com padrão de segurança. Se não foi culpa sua, podemos tratar da seguradora do outro condutor. [Confirmar.]","[Depends on damage and parts]":"[Depende do dano e das peças]","Free written estimate":"Orçamento grátis por escrito","Collision damage, insurance work":"Danos de colisão, trabalhos de seguros","Not your fault? Read this":"Não foi culpa sua? Leia isto","Alloy wheel refurbishment":"Recuperação de jantes de liga","Kerb damage, flaking lacquer and worn finishes made good, so the wheels match the rest of the car again. [Confirm that SVR offers this.]":"Danos de lancil, verniz a descascar e acabamentos gastos recuperados, para as jantes voltarem a combinar com o resto do carro. [Confirmar que a SVR oferece isto.]","From [£000] per wheel":"Desde [£000] por jante","Kerb rash, peeling lacquer":"Raspões de lancil, verniz a descascar","Polishing and paint correction":"Polimento e correção de pintura","Swirl marks, faded lacquer and light scratches removed by machine, with no paint added. The gloss comes back, and so does the depth of colour.":"Marcas circulares, verniz baço e riscos leves removidos à máquina, sem acrescentar tinta. O brilho volta, e a profundidade da cor também.","[1 day]":"[1 dia]","Dull or swirled paint":"Pintura baça ou com marcas circulares","Questions about repairs":"Perguntas sobre reparações","How do I know which repair I need?":"Como sei de que reparação preciso?","Send us photos or call in. We will tell you plainly, and if a smaller repair will do, we will say so.":"Envie-nos fotos ou passe por cá. Dizemos-lhe com clareza e, se uma reparação menor chegar, dizemos isso mesmo.","Will the repaired panel match the rest of the car?":"O painel reparado vai combinar com o resto do carro?","We match your paint code, test on a card and blend into the next panel. Paint fades over time, so we match what is on your car now.":"Igualamos o código de tinta, testamos num cartão e fundimos com o painel ao lado. A tinta desbota com o tempo, por isso igualamos o que o seu carro tem agora.","Do you work with insurers?":"Trabalham com seguradoras?","[Confirm.] Yes. For a claim that was not your fault, we send the photos and estimate to the insurer.":"[Confirmar.] Sim. Num sinistro que não foi culpa sua, enviamos as fotos e o orçamento à seguradora.","Is the estimate free?":"O orçamento é grátis?","Yes, with no obligation.":"Sim, sem compromisso.","Not sure what you need?":"Não sabe do que precisa?","Send us a photo on WhatsApp. We usually reply within [one working day].":"Envie-nos uma foto por WhatsApp. Normalmente respondemos em [um dia útil].","Use the estimate form":"Use o formulário de orçamento","Spray gun painting car panels":"Pistola de pintura a pintar painéis de carro","Technician removing a dent from a door":"Técnico a tirar uma amolgadela de uma porta","Technician spraying a car bumper":"Técnico a pintar um para-choques","Car bodyshell in a spray booth":"Carroçaria de carro numa cabine de pintura","Painter spraying a stripped car in the booth":"Pintor a pintar um carro desmontado na cabine","Technician polishing a car panel":"Técnico a polir um painel de carro","Sample reading":"Leitura de exemplo","Plastic":"Plástico","Bumpers are plastic, so we inspect them visually.":"Os para-choques são de plástico, por isso inspecionamo-los visualmente.","Within the normal range for factory paint.":"Dentro do intervalo normal para tinta de fábrica.","Thicker than factory: this panel has been resprayed.":"Mais grossa do que a de fábrica: este painel foi repintado.","Very thick: body filler is likely under the paint.":"Muito grossa: provavelmente há betume sob a tinta.","Front bumper":"Para-choques dianteiro","Boot lid":"Tampa da bagageira","Rear bumper":"Para-choques traseiro","Front left wing":"Guarda-lamas dianteiro esquerdo","Front left door":"Porta dianteira esquerda","Rear left door":"Porta traseira esquerda","Rear left quarter":"Painel lateral traseiro esquerdo","Front right wing":"Guarda-lamas dianteiro direito","Front right door":"Porta dianteira direita","Rear right door":"Porta traseira direita","Rear right quarter":"Painel lateral traseiro direito","Factory paint.":"Tinta de fábrica.","Repainted.":"Repintado.","Filler likely.":"Provável betume.","We speak Portuguese":"Falamos português","Send your photos on WhatsApp and get your estimate explained clearly, in Portuguese. [Confirm that SVR can offer Portuguese-speaking service.]":"Envie as suas fotos por WhatsApp e receba o orçamento explicado com clareza, em português. [Confirmar que a SVR pode atender em português.]","A clear written estimate, no surprises":"Orçamento claro por escrito, sem surpresas","We deal with your insurer, step by step":"Tratamos da seguradora consigo, passo a passo","Updates on WhatsApp, in your language":"Novidades por WhatsApp, na sua língua","Ask in Portuguese":"Peça em português","Photos of the damage (optional)":"Fotos do dano (opcional)","Add photos":"Adicionar fotos","Up to 5 photos. They are not uploaded to this website: they only leave your phone through WhatsApp.":"Até 5 fotos. Não são enviadas para este site: só saem do seu telemóvel pelo WhatsApp.","You can add up to 5 photos.":"Pode adicionar até 5 fotos.","Remove photo":"Remover foto","Photo of the damage":"Foto do dano","Shared. Make sure you pressed send in WhatsApp.":"Partilhado. Confirme que carregou em enviar no WhatsApp.","Email cannot attach photos from this page. Please add them in your email app.":"O e-mail não pode anexar fotos a partir desta página. Junte-as na sua aplicação de e-mail.","Only what you send us: your name, phone number, registration, car details, a description of the damage and any photos. Photos stay on your device until you send them by WhatsApp. This website does not upload or store them.":"Apenas o que nos envia: o seu nome, telefone, matrícula, dados do carro, uma descrição do dano e as fotos que juntar. As fotos ficam no seu telemóvel até as enviar por WhatsApp. Este site não as carrega nem as guarda.","Open menu":"Abrir menu","Close menu":"Fechar menu","Language":"Idioma","Home":"Início","Skip to content":"Saltar para o conteúdo","Car body repair & paint · Jersey":"Chapa e pintura automóvel · Jersey","Written guarantee":"Garantia por escrito","Also:":"Também:","Rust and underseal":"Ferrugem e proteção inferior","Paint protection":"Proteção da pintura","Fleet and trade":"Frotas e profissionais","Rust":"Ferrugem","Protection":"Proteção","Fleet":"Frotas","Rust repair and underseal":"Reparação de ferrugem e proteção inferior","After a crash? Do these four things first.":"Bateu? Faça primeiro estas quatro coisas.","It is stressful. This is the short version, whether you claim or pay yourself.":"É stressante. Esta é a versão curta, quer apresente o sinistro ao seguro quer pague do seu bolso.","Check everyone is safe":"Verifique se todos estão bem","Move to a safe place if you can. Call 999 if anyone is hurt or the road is blocked.":"Se puder, vá para um local seguro. Ligue 999 se alguém estiver ferido ou a estrada estiver bloqueada.","Photograph everything":"Fotografe tudo","Both cars, the damage close up, the number plates and the position on the road.":"Os dois carros, os danos de perto, as matrículas e a posição na estrada.","Swap details":"Troque contactos","Name, phone, insurer and registration for every driver. Note any witnesses.":"Nome, telefone, seguradora e matrícula de cada condutor. Anote testemunhas.","Send us the photos":"Envie-nos as fotos","We will tell you what needs doing and whether you can choose your own repairer.":"Dizemos-lhe o que é preciso e se pode escolher a sua própria oficina.","General guidance, not legal or insurance advice. Always check your policy. If anyone is hurt, call 999 first.":"Orientação geral, não é aconselhamento jurídico nem de seguros. Verifique sempre a sua apólice. Se alguém estiver ferido, ligue primeiro 999.","Send photos on WhatsApp":"Enviar fotos no WhatsApp","Vans, company cars and small fleets":"Furgões, carros de empresa e pequenas frotas","One contact for bodywork and paint across your vans, company cars or small fleet. Planned around your schedule, with one clear estimate per vehicle. [Confirm with SVR.]":"Um único contacto para chapa e pintura dos seus furgões, carros de empresa ou pequena frota. Trabalho planeado ao seu ritmo, com um orçamento claro por veículo. [Confirmar com a SVR.]","Ask about fleet work":"Perguntar sobre frotas","Do you offer a courtesy car, collection or delivery?":"Têm carro de substituição, recolha ou entrega?","[Confirm availability.] Ask when you book. If we cannot lend you a car, we will tell you before you leave yours with us.":"[Confirmar disponibilidade.] Pergunte ao marcar. Se não pudermos emprestar um carro, dizemos-lhe antes de deixar o seu connosco.","Do you repair rust and underseal?":"Reparam ferrugem e proteção inferior?","Yes. Jersey salt air is hard on sills, arches and the underside. We cut out rust properly and can renew underseal. [Confirm the exact treatment SVR offers.]":"Sim. O ar salgado de Jersey ataca as soleiras, cavas das rodas e a parte inferior. Cortamos a ferrugem como deve ser e podemos renovar a proteção inferior. [Confirmar o tratamento exato que a SVR oferece.]","Do you work on hybrids and electric cars?":"Trabalham com carros híbridos e elétricos?","[Confirm with SVR.] We work on all makes and models. For high-voltage work, we would use a qualified specialist and tell you before we start.":"[Confirmar com a SVR.] Trabalhamos com todas as marcas e modelos. Em trabalhos de alta tensão, recorremos a um especialista qualificado e avisamos antes de começar.","Can you recalibrate driver aids after a repair?":"Podem recalibrar as ajudas à condução depois de uma reparação?","[Confirm with SVR.] Cars with cameras and radar behind the glass or bumper often need recalibration after a repair. We can arrange it with a local specialist.":"[Confirmar com a SVR.] Carros com câmaras e radar atrás do vidro ou do para-choques precisam muitas vezes de recalibração. Podemos tratar disso com um especialista local.","How do I pay?":"Como posso pagar?","[Confirm accepted payment methods.] We give you a written estimate first, and an invoice when the car is ready.":"[Confirmar formas de pagamento.] Primeiro damos um orçamento por escrito e uma fatura quando o carro estiver pronto.","What to send":"O que enviar","Your registration and the car model":"A sua matrícula e o modelo do carro","Three photos: both sides, a close-up of the damage, and the whole car":"Três fotos: os dois lados, o dano de perto e o carro inteiro","What happened, and your preferred drop-off day":"O que aconteceu e o dia em que prefere deixar o carro","Preferred drop-off day (optional)":"Dia preferido para deixar o carro (opcional)","Cookies":"Cookies","This website does not set cookies and does not load fonts or images from third parties. Everything it needs is served from this site.":"Este site não usa cookies nem carrega tipos de letra ou imagens de terceiros. Tudo o que precisa é servido a partir deste site.","Accessibility":"Acessibilidade","We aim to meet WCAG 2.2 AA: readable contrast, keyboard navigation, visible focus, large touch targets and support for reduced motion. If something is hard to use, call us and we will help.":"Queremos cumprir as WCAG 2.2 AA: contraste legível, navegação por teclado, foco visível, botões grandes e respeito pela redução de movimento. Se algo for difícil de usar, ligue-nos e ajudamos.","SVR painter spraying a car panel in the spray booth":"Pintor da SVR a aplicar tinta num painel na cabine","Salt air and wet lanes find every sill, arch and seam. We cut out the rust, treat the metal, repair the panel and renew the underseal so it does not come straight back. [Confirm the exact treatment SVR offers.]":"O ar salgado e as estradas molhadas chegam a cada soleira, cava e junta. Cortamos a ferrugem, tratamos o metal, reparamos o painel e renovamos a proteção inferior para não voltar tão cedo. [Confirmar o tratamento exato que a SVR oferece.]","[2 to 5 days]":"[2 a 5 dias]","Sills, arches, boot floors":"Soleiras, cavas das rodas, fundo da bagageira","Fresh paint needs looking after. A wax, sealant or ceramic coating helps it stay glossy and makes salt, bird lime and tar easier to wash off. [Confirm which products SVR uses.]":"A pintura nova precisa de cuidados. Uma cera, selante ou revestimento cerâmico ajuda a manter o brilho e facilita a lavagem de sal, excrementos de aves e alcatrão. [Confirmar quais os produtos que a SVR usa.]","New paint, dark colours":"Pintura nova, cores escuras","Panels, doors, wings and the work behind them, repaired and finished to a safe standard. If it was not your fault, we can deal with the other driver’s insurer for you. [Confirm.] If the car has cameras or radar, we arrange recalibration after the repair. [Confirm.]":"Painéis, portas, guarda-lamas e o trabalho por trás, reparados e acabados com segurança. Se não foi culpa sua, podemos tratar do seguro do outro condutor. [Confirmar.] Se o carro tiver câmaras ou radar, combinamos a recalibração depois da reparação. [Confirmar.]","Vans, company cars or a small fleet: one contact, one clear estimate per vehicle, and work planned around your schedule. [Confirm with SVR.]":"Furgões, carros de empresa ou uma pequena frota: um único contacto, um orçamento claro por veículo e trabalho planeado ao seu ritmo. [Confirmar com a SVR.]","Car in the workshop being checked underneath":"Carro na oficina a ser verificado por baixo","Technician applying protection to a painted panel":"Técnico a aplicar proteção num painel pintado","Do you scan the car before and after a repair?":"Fazem uma leitura eletrónica antes e depois da reparação?","[Confirm with SVR.] Modern cars have sensors and computers. If a scan is needed, we arrange it with a local specialist and include it in the estimate.":"[Confirmar com a SVR.] Os carros modernos têm sensores e computadores. Se for preciso uma leitura, tratamos disso com um especialista local e incluímos no orçamento.","How should I look after fresh paint?":"Como devo cuidar da pintura nova?","Avoid washing the car for [confirm: about a week], and no wax or polish for [confirm: about a month]. We give you written aftercare when you collect.":"Não lave o carro durante [confirmar: cerca de uma semana] e não aplique cera nem polimento durante [confirmar: cerca de um mês]. Damos-lhe instruções escritas de cuidado quando o levantar.","What if something is not right after the repair?":"E se algo não ficar bem depois da reparação?","Tell us straight away. We will look at it and put it right. [Confirm the process.]":"Diga-nos imediatamente. Vamos ver e corrigir. [Confirmar o processo.]","MOCKUP: example photos. [ ] = real workshop details to come.":"MAQUETA: fotografias de exemplo. [ ] = dados reais da oficina por chegar.","Car body repair and paint in Jersey for dents, scratches and accident damage. Colour-matched to your paint code, finished so the repair disappears, and guaranteed in writing.":"Reparação de chapa e pintura em Jersey para amolgadelas, riscos e danos de acidente. Cor igualada ao seu código de pintura, acabamento que faz a reparação desaparecer e garantia por escrito.","Colour-matched to your paint code":"Cor igualada ao código de pintura","Prepared, primed and painted in a controlled booth, then we deal with your insurer if you wish.":"Preparado, apontado e pintado em cabine controlada; se quiser, tratamos do seguro por si.","Both cars, a close-up of the damage, the number plates and the position on the road.":"Os dois carros, uma foto de perto do dano, as matrículas e a posição na estrada.","Demo effect on a stock photo. Replace with the workshop’s own before-and-after photos, with each owner’s permission.":"Efeito de demonstração numa foto de banco de imagens. Substituir por fotos de antes e depois da própria oficina, com autorização de cada proprietário.","A history report can show outstanding finance, past write-offs and mileage records from UK databases.":"Um relatório de histórico pode mostrar financiamentos pendentes, sinistros totais anteriores e registos de quilometragem de bases de dados do Reino Unido.","Every panel is checked in bright light before we call you.":"Cada painel é verificado com luz forte antes de o contactarmos.","Fresh jobs from the spray booth, before-and-after photos, and the odd classic. Follow SVR on Instagram.":"Trabalhos recentes da cabine, fotos de antes e depois e um ou outro clássico. Siga a SVR no Instagram.","Can you recalibrate driver-assistance systems after a repair?":"Podem recalibrar os sistemas de assistência à condução depois de uma reparação?","[Confirm with SVR.] Cars with cameras and radar behind the windscreen or bumper often need recalibration after a repair. We can arrange it with a local specialist.":"[Confirmar com a SVR.] Carros com câmaras e radar atrás do para-brisas ou do para-choques precisam muitas vezes de recalibração. Podemos tratar disso com um especialista local.","Do not wash the car for [confirm: about a week], and do not wax or polish it for [confirm: about a month]. We give you written aftercare when you collect.":"Não lave o carro durante [confirmar: cerca de uma semana] e não aplique cera nem polimento durante [confirmar: cerca de um mês]. Damos-lhe instruções escritas de cuidado quando o levantar.","Your registration and the car’s make and model":"A sua matrícula e a marca e modelo do carro","Book your appointment now @svrje2023":"Reserve a sua marcação agora @svrje2023","Jersey, Channel Islands":"Jersey, Ilhas do Canal","Mockup: example photos. [ ] = real workshop details to come.":"Maquete: fotografias de exemplo. [ ] = dados reais da oficina por chegar.","Mockup: example photos and text. Prices and times in [ ] to be confirmed with SVR.":"Maquete: fotografias e texto de exemplo. Preços e prazos entre [ ] a confirmar com a SVR.","Mockup: concept page. Sample report only, not a real vehicle. [ ] = to confirm with SVR.":"Maquete: página conceito. Apenas relatório de exemplo, não é um veículo real. [ ] = a confirmar com a SVR.","Car Body Repair & Paint in Jersey | SVR Sienna Vehicle Refinishing":"Chapa e pintura auto em Jersey | SVR Sienna Vehicle Refinishing","Car Body Repair Services in Jersey | SVR":"Serviços de chapa e pintura em Jersey | SVR","Used Car Bodywork Check in Jersey | SVR Car Check":"Verificação de carroçaria de carros usados em Jersey | SVR Car Check","Hello SVR, I would like a free estimate.":"Olá SVR, gostaria de um orçamento gratuito.","Registration":"Matrícula","Car":"Carro","Name":"Nome","What happened":"O que aconteceu","Preferred drop-off":"Dia preferido para entregar","Estimate request":"Pedido de orçamento","Pre-purchase bodywork inspection for a car I am thinking of buying.":"Verificação de chapa antes de comprar um carro."},"pl":{"MOCKUP: free-licence example photos. [ ] = real workshop details to come.":"MAKIETA: zdjęcia przykładowe na wolnej licencji. [ ] = dane warsztatu do uzupełnienia.","Services":"Usługi","Process":"Proces","Standards":"Standardy","Reviews":"Opinie","Contact":"Kontakt","Flawless":"Bezbłędne","finish.":"wykończenie.","Every panel.":"Na każdym elemencie.","Refined over 20 years. Finished to perfection.":"Ponad 20 lat doświadczenia. Wykończenie perfekcyjne.","Car body repair and paint in Jersey, for dents, scratches and accident damage. Colour matched to your paint code, finished so you cannot find the repair, and guaranteed in writing.":"Naprawy blacharskie i lakiernicze w Jersey: wgniecenia, zarysowania i szkody powypadkowe. Kolor dobrany do kodu lakieru, wykończony tak, że naprawy nie widać, z pisemną gwarancją.","Get a free estimate":"Poproś o bezpłatną wycenę","WhatsApp your photos":"Wyślij zdjęcia na WhatsApp","Call [01534 000000]":"Zadzwoń: [01534 000000]","Scratch repair":"Naprawa zarysowań","Dent removal":"Usuwanie wgnieceń","Full respray":"Pełne lakierowanie","Accident repair":"Naprawa powypadkowa","Colour matching":"Dobór koloru","Alloy wheels":"Felgi aluminiowe","Polishing":"Polerowanie","Whatever happened to your car":"Cokolwiek stało się z Twoim autem","Send us a photo and we will tell you plainly what it needs. Sometimes that is a small repair, not a respray.":"Wyślij nam zdjęcie, a powiemy wprost, czego potrzeba. Czasem to mała naprawa, a nie lakierowanie całości.","Dents without the respray":"Wgniecenia bez lakierowania","Paintless dent removal where the paint is unbroken. Panel work where it is not.":"Usuwanie wgnieceń bez lakierowania, gdy lakier jest cały. Gdy nie jest, naprawiamy element.","From [£000]":"Od [£000]","Accident and bumper repair":"Naprawa powypadkowa i zderzaków","Prepared, primed and painted in a controlled booth, then handled with your insurer if you wish.":"Przygotowane, zagruntowane i polakierowane w kontrolowanej kabinie, a jeśli chcesz, załatwimy też sprawę z ubezpieczycielem.","Free estimate":"Bezpłatna wycena","Polish and protect":"Polerowanie i ochrona","Swirl marks, faded lacquer and light scratches brought back to a mirror shine.":"Hologramy, zmatowiały lakier i drobne rysy odzyskują lustrzany połysk.","[Confirm with the workshop which services it really offers, and prices.]":"[Ustalić z warsztatem, jakie usługi naprawdę oferuje, oraz ceny.]","Not your fault? We deal with the insurer.":"To nie Twoja wina? Zajmiemy się ubezpieczycielem.","If someone else caused the damage, you should not have to chase anyone. We send the photos and the estimate to the insurers, handle the back and forth, and keep you updated until your car is home.":"Jeśli szkodę spowodował ktoś inny, nie powinieneś nikogo ścigać. Wysyłamy zdjęcia i wycenę do ubezpieczycieli, prowadzimy korespondencję i informujemy Cię na bieżąco, aż auto wróci do domu.","In most cases you can choose who repairs your car":"W większości przypadków możesz wybrać, kto naprawia Twoje auto","Photos and a written estimate sent straight to the insurer":"Zdjęcia i pisemna wycena wysłane bezpośrednio do ubezpieczyciela","Updates by WhatsApp until the job is done":"Informacje na WhatsApp do zakończenia pracy","Tell us what happened":"Opowiedz, co się stało","[Confirm SVR offers insurance claims handling, and check the wording with a Jersey insurer.]":"[Potwierdzić, że SVR obsługuje szkody ubezpieczeniowe, i sprawdzić treść z ubezpieczycielem z Jersey.]","How your car comes back perfect":"Tak Twoje auto wraca idealne","Scroll to follow a repair from the first look to the keys in your hand.":"Przewijaj, aby prześledzić naprawę od pierwszych oględzin do kluczyków w ręce.","Step 1":"Krok 1","We look, you get a price":"Oglądamy i podajemy cenę","Send photos or drop in. You receive a clear written estimate, usually within [one working day], with no obligation.":"Wyślij zdjęcia lub wpadnij. Dostaniesz jasną pisemną wycenę, zwykle w ciągu [jednego dnia roboczego], bez zobowiązań.","Step 2":"Krok 2","Strip back and repair":"Rozbiórka i naprawa","Dents are pulled, rust is cut out, and the panel is prepared properly. This is where most of a good finish is won.":"Wgniecenia są wyciągane, rdza wycinana, a element starannie przygotowany. To tutaj wygrywa się większość dobrego wykończenia.","Step 3":"Krok 3","Your exact colour":"Dokładnie Twój kolor","Mixed to your paint code and tested on a spray-out card beside the car, then blended into the next panel.":"Mieszany według kodu lakieru i sprawdzany na próbniku obok auta, a potem wtapiany w sąsiedni element.","Step 4":"Krok 4","Baked in the booth":"Wypalanie w kabinie","Dust-free spraying, then heat curing for a hard, glossy lacquer that lasts.":"Lakierowanie bez kurzu, a potem utwardzanie ciepłem dla twardego, błyszczącego i trwałego lakieru bezbarwnego.","Step 5":"Krok 5","Polished by hand and machine":"Polerowanie ręczne i maszynowe","Every panel is checked in bright light and polished until the repair disappears.":"Każdy element jest sprawdzany w jasnym świetle i polerowany, aż naprawa zniknie.","Step 6":"Krok 6","Collect it, guaranteed":"Odbierz z gwarancją","Cleaned inside and out, with a written guarantee. [Guarantee terms to confirm.]":"Czyste w środku i na zewnątrz, z pisemną gwarancją. [Warunki gwarancji do potwierdzenia.]","Before":"Przed","After":"Po","Demo effect on a stock photo. Replace with the workshop’s own before and after photos, with each owner’s permission.":"Efekt demonstracyjny na zdjęciu stockowym. Zastąpić zdjęciami przed i po z własnego warsztatu, za zgodą każdego właściciela.","See the difference":"Zobacz różnicę","Drag across the car. Our job is to make the repair impossible to find: same colour, same gloss, same finish as the factory.":"Przeciągnij po aucie. Naszym zadaniem jest, by naprawy nie dało się znaleźć: ten sam kolor, ten sam połysk, to samo wykończenie co fabryczne.","Get yours looked at":"Zleć oględziny","Buying a used car? Check it first.":"Kupujesz używane auto? Najpierw je sprawdź.","A clean history does not mean a clean car. Hidden repairs, filler and resprays only show up when someone measures the paint.":"Czysta historia nie oznacza czystego auta. Ukryte naprawy, szpachla i przemalowania wychodzą na jaw dopiero, gdy ktoś zmierzy lakier.","Pre-purchase bodywork inspection":"Kontrola blacharska przed zakupem","Before you buy, we check every panel with a paint thickness gauge and inspect the car in bright light. You get a short written report with photos, so you know exactly what you are paying for.":"Przed zakupem sprawdzamy każdy element miernikiem grubości lakieru i oglądamy auto w jasnym świetle. Dostajesz krótki pisemny raport ze zdjęciami, żeby wiedzieć, za co dokładnie płacisz.","[Price to confirm with SVR]":"[Cena do ustalenia z SVR]","Example reading, for illustration":"Przykładowy pomiar, tylko poglądowo","paint depth (µm)":"grubość lakieru (µm)","Bonnet":"Maska","Front wing":"Błotnik przedni","Front door":"Drzwi przednie","Rear door":"Drzwi tylne","Roof":"Dach","A much thicker reading on one panel usually means it has been repainted.":"Znacznie grubszy odczyt na jednym elemencie zwykle oznacza, że był lakierowany.","Book an inspection":"Zarezerwuj kontrolę","See SVR Car Check":"Zobacz SVR Car Check","Online history check":"Sprawdzenie historii online","A history report can show outstanding finance, past write-offs and mileage records, from UK databases.":"Raport historii może pokazać zaległe finansowanie, dawne szkody całkowite i dane o przebiegu z baz brytyjskich.","Best for cars with a previous UK registration":"Najlepsze dla aut z wcześniejszą rejestracją w Wielkiej Brytanii","Paid service, run by a third party":"Usługa płatna, świadczona przez stronę trzecią","Check a history online":"Sprawdź historię online","Opens carVertical, an independent website. SVR is not responsible for its reports. [Confirm which provider SVR wants to recommend.]":"Otwiera carVertical, niezależną stronę. SVR nie odpowiada za jej raporty. [Ustalić, którego dostawcę SVR chce polecać.]","Our standards":"Nasze standardy","You expect a repair you cannot spot, and a workshop that keeps its word. This is what we commit to on every job.":"Oczekujesz naprawy, której nie widać, i warsztatu, który dotrzymuje słowa. Do tego zobowiązujemy się przy każdym zleceniu.","A written, itemised estimate":"Pisemna, szczegółowa wycena","The price is agreed before any work starts. If anything changes, we ask you first.":"Cena jest ustalana przed rozpoczęciem prac. Jeśli cokolwiek się zmieni, najpierw pytamy Ciebie.","Colour matched to your paint code":"Kolor dobrany do kodu lakieru","Checked on a spray-out card in daylight and blended into the neighbouring panel.":"Sprawdzany na próbniku w świetle dziennym i wtapiany w sąsiedni element.","Progress updates":"Informacje o postępach","Photos and a message at each stage, by WhatsApp or phone. [To confirm.]":"Zdjęcia i wiadomość na każdym etapie, przez WhatsApp lub telefon. [Do potwierdzenia.]","Honest advice":"Uczciwa rada","If a smaller repair will do, we will tell you, even when it costs us the bigger job.":"Jeśli wystarczy mniejsza naprawa, powiemy to, nawet gdy kosztuje nas to większe zlecenie.","Inspected before handover":"Kontrola przed wydaniem","Every panel is checked under bright light before we call you.":"Każdy element jest sprawdzany w jasnym świetle, zanim do Ciebie zadzwonimy.","Guaranteed in writing":"Gwarancja na piśmie","[Guarantee terms to confirm with SVR.]":"[Warunki gwarancji do ustalenia z SVR.]","[Insurer approvals, if held]":"[Zatwierdzenia ubezpieczycieli, jeśli posiadane]","[Trade body membership, if held]":"[Członkostwo w branżowej organizacji, jeśli posiadane]","[Manufacturer paint system, if used]":"[System lakierniczy producenta, jeśli używany]","Only show an accreditation once SVR can prove it. Better a short, true list than a long one.":"Pokazywać akredytację dopiero, gdy SVR może ją udowodnić. Lepsza krótka, prawdziwa lista niż długa.","years of experience":"lat doświadczenia","vehicles repaired [to confirm]":"naprawionych pojazdów [do potwierdzenia]","average Google rating [to confirm]":"średnia ocena w Google [do potwierdzenia]","parishes covered":"obsługiwane parafie","Made for Jersey roads":"Stworzone dla dróg Jersey","Narrow lanes, hedges, coastal car parks and salt in the air. We see the same problems all year, and we know how to fix them.":"Wąskie drogi, żywopłoty, nadmorskie parkingi i sól w powietrzu. Widzimy te same problemy przez cały rok i wiemy, jak je naprawić.","Hedge scrapes":"Otarcia o żywopłot","Fine scratches along one side. Often polish out; deeper ones need paint.":"Drobne rysy wzdłuż jednego boku. Często da się je wypolerować; głębsze wymagają lakieru.","Salt-air rust":"Rdza od słonego powietrza","Small bubbles near wheel arches and sills. Fix them early, before they spread.":"Małe bąble przy nadkolach i progach. Napraw je wcześnie, zanim się rozszerzą.","Car-park dings":"Wgniecenia z parkingu","Shallow dents with unbroken paint can often be pushed out without a respray.":"Płytkie wgniecenia przy nienaruszonym lakierze często można wypchnąć bez lakierowania.","20+ years. Run by the people who do the work":"Ponad 20 lat. Prowadzą ludzie, którzy wykonują pracę","SVR (Sienna Vehicle Refinishing) is owned and run by Guillermo Goveia and Gabriel Das Neves. When you bring your car in, you deal with them directly, from the estimate to the final check.":"SVR (Sienna Vehicle Refinishing) należy do Guillermo Goveia i Gabriela Das Neves i jest przez nich prowadzona. Gdy przyjeżdżasz z autem, rozmawiasz bezpośrednio z nimi, od wyceny do końcowej kontroli.","[Add a short line about their background, and a photo of both if they agree.]":"[Dodać krótki opis ich doświadczenia i wspólne zdjęcie, jeśli się zgodzą.]","See the work as it happens":"Zobacz pracę na żywo","Fresh jobs from the spray booth, before and afters, and the odd classic. Follow SVR on Instagram.":"Świeże prace z kabiny lakierniczej, przed i po, a czasem klasyk. Obserwuj SVR na Instagramie.","Follow @svrje2023":"Obserwuj @svrje2023","Post shown as published on SVR’s Instagram. [Swap in more posts, or a live feed, later.]":"Post pokazany tak, jak opublikowano na Instagramie SVR. [Później dodać więcej postów lub kanał na żywo.]","What customers say":"Co mówią klienci","Sample wording only. Use real reviews, with permission.":"Tylko przykładowy tekst. Użyć prawdziwych opinii, za zgodą.","“Sample review: I couldn’t tell where the repair was. The colour match was spot on.”":"„Przykładowa opinia: nie mogłem znaleźć miejsca naprawy. Kolor idealnie dopasowany.”","[Customer name], St Helier":"[Imię klienta], St Helier","“Sample review: they dealt with my insurer and kept me updated every day.”":"„Przykładowa opinia: zajęli się moim ubezpieczycielem i informowali mnie codziennie.”","[Customer name], St Brelade":"[Imię klienta], St Brelade","“Sample review: fair price, honest advice, and the car came back spotless.”":"„Przykładowa opinia: uczciwa cena, szczera rada, a auto wróciło bez skazy.”","[Customer name], Grouville":"[Imię klienta], Grouville","Questions we get asked":"Najczęstsze pytania","Do I have to use my insurer’s repairer?":"Czy muszę korzystać z warsztatu ubezpieczyciela?","[Confirm for Jersey insurers.] In most cases you can choose your own repairer. Check your policy, or ask us and we will help.":"[Potwierdzić dla ubezpieczycieli z Jersey.] W większości przypadków możesz wybrać własny warsztat. Sprawdź polisę lub zapytaj nas, pomożemy.","How long will it take?":"Ile to potrwa?","Small repairs can take a day or two. Larger jobs depend on parts and damage. We give you a date with your estimate.":"Małe naprawy mogą zająć dzień lub dwa. Większe prace zależą od części i uszkodzeń. Datę podajemy razem z wyceną.","Will the colour match?":"Czy kolor będzie pasował?","We use your car’s paint code, test on a spray-out card and blend into neighbouring panels. Paint fades over time, so we match what is on your car now.":"Używamy kodu lakieru Twojego auta, testujemy na próbniku i wtapiamy w sąsiednie elementy. Lakier z czasem blaknie, więc dopasowujemy to, co jest na Twoim aucie teraz.","Is the estimate really free?":"Czy wycena naprawdę jest bezpłatna?","Yes, with no obligation. Photos give a good guide; we confirm in person.":"Tak, bez zobowiązań. Zdjęcia dają dobry obraz; potwierdzamy osobiście.","Do you offer a courtesy car?":"Czy macie auto zastępcze?","[Confirm availability.] Ask when you book.":"[Potwierdzić dostępność.] Zapytaj przy rezerwacji.","Fill this in and press send. WhatsApp opens with your details ready, so you can add photos of the damage in the same chat. We usually reply within [one working day].":"Wypełnij i naciśnij wyślij. Otworzy się WhatsApp z Twoimi danymi, więc w tej samej rozmowie możesz dodać zdjęcia uszkodzenia. Zwykle odpowiadamy w ciągu [jednego dnia roboczego].","Start with your registration":"Zacznij od numeru rejestracyjnego","As shown on your Jersey number plate.":"Jak na tablicy rejestracyjnej z Jersey.","Car make and model":"Marka i model auta","Your name":"Twoje imię","Phone":"Telefon","What happened?":"Co się stało?","We use your details only to reply to your enquiry. See our":"Używamy Twoich danych wyłącznie do odpowiedzi na zapytanie. Zobacz naszą","privacy notice":"informację o prywatności","Send on WhatsApp":"Wyślij przez WhatsApp","No WhatsApp?":"Bez WhatsApp?","Send it by email instead":"Wyślij zamiast tego e-mailem","WhatsApp is opening with your message. Add photos of the damage in the chat, then press send.":"WhatsApp otwiera się z Twoją wiadomością. Dodaj zdjęcia uszkodzenia w rozmowie i naciśnij wyślij.","Find us":"Gdzie jesteśmy","[Address], [Parish], Jersey [JE_ ___]":"[Adres], [Parafia], Jersey [JE_ ___]","Monday to Friday":"Poniedziałek–piątek","Saturday":"Sobota","Sunday":"Niedziela","Closed":"Zamknięte","Map goes here":"Tu będzie mapa","(free OpenStreetMap)":"(bezpłatna OpenStreetMap)","Privacy notice":"Informacja o prywatności","Who we are":"Kim jesteśmy","SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, [address], Jersey [JE_ ___]. Contact: [email@address].":"SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, [adres], Jersey [JE_ ___]. Kontakt: [email@address].","What we collect":"Co zbieramy","Why we use it":"Do czego używamy","To reply to your enquiry, give you an estimate and carry out the repair. We do not sell your details or send marketing without asking first.":"Aby odpowiedzieć na zapytanie, przygotować wycenę i wykonać naprawę. Nie sprzedajemy Twoich danych ani nie wysyłamy reklam bez wcześniejszej zgody.","How long we keep it":"Jak długo przechowujemy","[For example, up to two years after your last job.] Then it is deleted.":"[Na przykład do dwóch lat po ostatnim zleceniu.] Potem są usuwane.","Who else sees it":"Kto jeszcze je widzi","No one outside SVR, except the services you choose to contact us through. Messages sent by WhatsApp are also handled by WhatsApp (Meta).":"Nikt poza SVR, z wyjątkiem usług, przez które wybierzesz kontakt. Wiadomości wysłane przez WhatsApp przetwarza także WhatsApp (Meta).","Your rights":"Twoje prawa","You can ask to see, correct or delete your details at any time. If you are unhappy with how we use them, you can complain to the Jersey Office of the Information Commissioner.":"Możesz w każdej chwili poprosić o wgląd, poprawienie lub usunięcie swoich danych. Jeśli nie podoba Ci się, jak ich używamy, możesz złożyć skargę do Jersey Office of the Information Commissioner.","This website does not set cookies. It loads its fonts from Google Fonts. [Check before going live.]":"Ta strona nie używa plików cookie. Czcionki ładuje z Google Fonts. [Sprawdzić przed uruchomieniem.]","[Template only. Have it checked against the Data Protection (Jersey) Law 2018 before the site goes live.]":"[Tylko wzór. Przed uruchomieniem strony sprawdzić zgodność z Data Protection (Jersey) Law 2018.]","© [Year] SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, Jersey. Owners: Guillermo Goveia and Gabriel Das Neves. [Company registration number].":"© [Rok] SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, Jersey. Właściciele: Guillermo Goveia i Gabriel Das Neves. [Numer rejestracyjny firmy].","Book your appointment":"Umów wizytę","Call":"Zadzwoń","Estimate":"Wycena","SVR logo":"Logo SVR","Main":"Główna","SVR painter spraying a red car panel in the spray booth":"Lakiernik SVR lakieruje czerwony element w kabinie lakierniczej","Technician removing a dent from a car door panel":"Technik usuwa wgniecenie z drzwi samochodu","Technician in protective suit spraying a car bumper":"Technik w kombinezonie ochronnym lakieruje zderzak","Technician polishing a car panel with a machine":"Technik poleruje element karoserii maszyną","Car before repair (demo effect)":"Auto przed naprawą (efekt demonstracyjny)","Car after repair":"Auto po naprawie","Compare before and after":"Porównaj przed i po","Example paint thickness reading":"Przykładowy pomiar grubości lakieru","Accreditations":"Akredytacje","Parishes we cover":"Parafie, które obsługujemy","SVR painter spraying a red panel in the booth":"Lakiernik SVR lakieruje czerwony element w kabinie","5 stars":"5 gwiazdek","e.g. Volkswagen Golf":"np. Volkswagen Golf","e.g. scraped the rear door in a car park":"np. zarysowałem tylne drzwi na parkingu","MOCKUP: concept page. Sample report only, not a real vehicle. [ ] = to confirm with SVR.":"MAKIETA: strona koncepcyjna. Tylko przykładowy raport, nie prawdziwy pojazd. [ ] = do potwierdzenia z SVR.","← SVR home":"← Strona SVR","Know the car before you buy it.":"Poznaj auto, zanim je kupisz.","An independent bodywork and condition report for used cars in Jersey, carried out in person by the team at SVR.":"Niezależny raport o blacharce i stanie używanych aut w Jersey, wykonywany osobiście przez zespół SVR.","Registration of the car you are looking at":"Numer rejestracyjny oglądanego auta","Book a Car Check":"Zarezerwuj Car Check","See a sample report":"Zobacz przykładowy raport","Why in person?":"Dlaczego osobiście?","Jersey has no public vehicle history database. Online checks only cover cars with a UK past. So we check what matters most: the car itself.":"Jersey nie ma publicznej bazy historii pojazdów. Sprawdzenia online obejmują tylko auta z brytyjską przeszłością. Dlatego sprawdzamy to, co najważniejsze: samo auto.","Factory paint":"Lakier fabryczny","Repainted":"Przemalowane","Filler likely":"Prawdopodobna szpachla","What we check":"Co sprawdzamy","About [45 minutes] at the seller’s address or at our workshop. [Confirm with SVR.]":"Około [45 minut] u sprzedawcy lub w naszym warsztacie. [Potwierdzić z SVR.]","Paint depth on every panel":"Grubość lakieru na każdym elemencie","Measured with a gauge, to find resprays and hidden repairs.":"Mierzona miernikiem, by znaleźć przemalowania i ukryte naprawy.","Panel gaps and alignment":"Szczeliny i spasowanie elementów","Uneven gaps often point to an accident repair.":"Nierówne szczeliny często wskazują na naprawę powypadkową.","Signs of accident damage":"Ślady uszkodzeń powypadkowych","Overspray, replaced panels, welds and filler.":"Zamglenie lakierem, wymienione elementy, spawy i szpachla.","Rust from salt air":"Rdza od słonego powietrza","Sills, wheel arches and underside, where island cars suffer most.":"Progi, nadkola i spód, gdzie auta na wyspie cierpią najbardziej.","Identity matches the paperwork":"Tożsamość zgadza się z dokumentami","VIN on the car compared with the registration document (VRD1).":"Numer VIN na aucie porównany z dowodem rejestracyjnym (VRD1).","Photos of everything":"Zdjęcia wszystkiego","Every finding photographed and included in your report.":"Każde znalezisko jest sfotografowane i dołączone do raportu.","What you get":"Co dostajesz","A clear report on your phone, usually the same day. This is what one looks like.":"Jasny raport w telefonie, zwykle tego samego dnia. Tak wygląda taki raport.","SVR Car Check report":"Raport SVR Car Check","Example 5-door hatchback · Registration: SAMPLE":"Przykład: 5-drzwiowy hatchback · Rejestracja: PRZYKŁAD","Sample report, not a real vehicle":"Raport przykładowy, nie prawdziwy pojazd","Repaired, structurally sound":"Naprawiony, konstrukcyjnie w porządku","Two panels have been worked on. Fair to buy at the right price.":"Dwa elementy były naprawiane. Uczciwa cena, jeśli kupisz po właściwej kwocie.","Rear right quarter: filler likely":"Prawy tylny błotnik: prawdopodobna szpachla","Reading of 610 µm. Previous dent repaired with filler and repainted. Ask the seller about it.":"Odczyt 610 µm. Wcześniejsze wgniecenie naprawione szpachlą i przemalowane. Zapytaj sprzedawcę.","Check":"Sprawdź","Front right door: repainted":"Prawe przednie drzwi: przemalowane","Reading of 342 µm. Good quality respray, colour match is close.":"Odczyt 342 µm. Dobrej jakości lakierowanie, kolor zbliżony.","Minor":"Drobne","Sills and arches: light surface rust only":"Progi i nadkola: tylko lekka rdza powierzchniowa","Typical for a coastal car. Treat within a year.":"Typowe dla auta znad morza. Zająć się w ciągu roku.","VIN matches the registration document":"VIN zgadza się z dowodem rejestracyjnym","Chassis and windscreen VIN agree with the VRD1.":"VIN na nadwoziu i szybie zgadza się z VRD1.","Photo: rear quarter":"Zdjęcie: tylny błotnik","Photo: door edge":"Zdjęcie: krawędź drzwi","Photo: sill":"Zdjęcie: próg","Illustration of the report format. Readings and findings are examples, not data about any real car.":"Ilustracja formatu raportu. Odczyty i ustalenia to przykłady, nie dane prawdziwego auta.","How it works":"Jak to działa","Book":"Rezerwacja","Send the registration and where the car is. We confirm a time with you and the seller.":"Wyślij numer rejestracyjny i miejsce, gdzie jest auto. Ustalimy termin z Tobą i sprzedawcą.","We inspect":"Sprawdzamy","At the seller’s or at our workshop. You are welcome to come along.":"U sprzedawcy lub w naszym warsztacie. Możesz być przy tym obecny.","You decide":"Ty decydujesz","Your report arrives on WhatsApp, with photos and our honest view.":"Raport przychodzi na WhatsApp, ze zdjęciami i naszą szczerą opinią.","Prices":"Ceny","[Prices and inclusions to be set by SVR.]":"[Ceny i zakres do ustalenia przez SVR.]","Bodywork Check":"Kontrola blacharki","Panel gaps and accident signs":"Szczeliny elementów i ślady wypadku","Photo report on WhatsApp":"Raport ze zdjęciami na WhatsApp","Full Car Check":"Pełny Car Check","Everything in the Bodywork Check":"Wszystko z Kontroli blacharki","Rust and underside inspection":"Kontrola rdzy i spodu","VIN and paperwork check":"Sprawdzenie VIN i dokumentów","Written grade and buying advice":"Pisemna ocena i porada zakupowa","What a Car Check cannot tell you":"Czego Car Check nie powie","Outstanding finance or past ownership. Ask the seller for the VRD1 and receipts.":"Zaległego finansowania ani poprzednich właścicieli. Poproś sprzedawcę o VRD1 i rachunki.","Mileage history. Service records are your best guide.":"Historii przebiegu. Najlepszym przewodnikiem są książka serwisowa i rachunki.","Mechanical faults. For engine and gearbox, ask a mechanic too.":"Usterek mechanicznych. W sprawie silnika i skrzyni zapytaj też mechanika.","If the car was previously registered in the UK, an online history check on its old UK registration can add finance and write-off records.":"Jeśli auto było wcześniej zarejestrowane w Wielkiej Brytanii, sprawdzenie online po dawnym brytyjskim numerze może dodać dane o finansowaniu i szkodach całkowitych.","Questions":"Pytania","Does the seller need to agree?":"Czy sprzedawca musi się zgodzić?","Yes. Most honest sellers are happy to. If a seller refuses an independent check, that tells you something too.":"Tak. Większość uczciwych sprzedawców chętnie się zgadza. Jeśli sprzedawca odmawia niezależnej kontroli, to też coś mówi.","Can you check a car outside Jersey?":"Czy sprawdzicie auto poza Jersey?","[Confirm with SVR. For example, Jersey only.]":"[Potwierdzić z SVR. Na przykład tylko Jersey.]","Will you repair what you find?":"Czy naprawicie to, co znajdziecie?","Only if you ask. The report is independent, and you are free to get repairs done anywhere.":"Tylko jeśli poprosisz. Raport jest niezależny i możesz naprawić auto gdziekolwiek.","SVR Car Check is a service of SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, Jersey.":"SVR Car Check to usługa SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, Jersey.","Back to SVR":"Wróć do SVR","Interactive sample panel map":"Interaktywna przykładowa mapa elementów","Car seen from above, front at the top":"Auto widziane z góry, przód u góry","ES":"ES","See all services":"Zobacz wszystkie usługi","Jersey J registrations may not be covered":"Rejestracje J z Jersey mogą nie być objęte","Change language":"Zmień język","Our services":"Nasze usługi","SVR Services":"Usługi SVR","MOCKUP: example photos and text. Prices and times in [ ] to be confirmed with SVR.":"MAKIETA: przykładowe zdjęcia i tekst. Ceny i terminy w [ ] do potwierdzenia z SVR.","Every repair, done properly.":"Każda naprawa, wykonana jak należy.","From a single scratch to a full respray, here is what we do, how long it usually takes, and what to expect. Not sure which one you need? Send us a photo.":"Od jednej rysy po pełne lakierowanie: co robimy, ile to zwykle trwa i czego się spodziewać. Nie wiesz, której potrzebujesz? Wyślij nam zdjęcie.","Scratches":"Zarysowania","Dents":"Wgniecenia","Bumpers":"Zderzaki","Respray":"Lakierowanie","Scratch and scuff repair":"Naprawa rys i otarć","Hedge scrapes, car-park knocks and key marks. If the scratch has not gone through to the metal, it can often be repaired without painting the whole panel.":"Otarcia o żywopłot, uderzenia na parkingu i ślady po kluczu. Jeśli rysa nie sięgnęła blachy, często da się ją naprawić bez lakierowania całego elementu.","Usual time":"Zwykły czas","[1 to 2 days]":"[1 do 2 dni]","Price":"Cena","Best for":"Najlepsze dla","Light to medium scratches":"Lekkie i średnie rysy","Get an estimate":"Poproś o wycenę","Where the paint is unbroken, we can often push the dent out from behind with no filler and no respray. Where it is not, we repair the panel properly and repaint it.":"Tam, gdzie lakier jest cały, często wypychamy wgniecenie od tyłu, bez szpachli i lakierowania. Tam, gdzie nie, naprawiamy element porządnie i lakierujemy.","[Same day to 2 days]":"[Tego samego dnia do 2 dni]","Car-park dings, hail, small dents":"Wgniecenia z parkingu, grad, małe wgniecenia","Bumper repair":"Naprawa zderzaków","Cracks, scrapes and splits are repaired, primed and painted to match the rest of the car. If a bumper is beyond saving, we tell you before replacing it.":"Pęknięcia, otarcia i rozdarcia są naprawiane, gruntowane i lakierowane tak, by pasowały do reszty auta. Jeśli zderzaka nie da się uratować, powiemy to przed wymianą.","[2 to 3 days]":"[2 do 3 dni]","Parking scrapes, minor impacts":"Otarcia przy parkowaniu, drobne uderzenia","Full and part respray":"Pełne i częściowe lakierowanie","Faded, peeling or damaged paint brought back. We match your paint code, test it on a spray-out card, and blend into the next panel so there is no visible join. Everything is cured in the booth.":"Wyblakły, łuszczący się lub uszkodzony lakier przywrócony. Dobieramy kod lakieru, testujemy na próbniku i wtapiamy w sąsiedni element, by nie było widać łączenia. Wszystko jest utwardzane w kabinie.","[Part: 2 to 4 days. Full: 1 to 2 weeks]":"[Częściowe: 2 do 4 dni. Pełne: 1 do 2 tygodni]","Faded or damaged paint, colour changes":"Wyblakły lub uszkodzony lakier, zmiana koloru","Panels, doors, wings and the work behind them, repaired and finished to a safe standard. If it was not your fault, we can deal with the other driver’s insurer for you. [Confirm.]":"Elementy, drzwi, błotniki i prace pod nimi, naprawione i wykończone według bezpiecznego standardu. Jeśli to nie Twoja wina, możemy zająć się ubezpieczycielem drugiego kierowcy. [Potwierdzić.]","[Depends on damage and parts]":"[Zależy od uszkodzeń i części]","Free written estimate":"Bezpłatna pisemna wycena","Collision damage, insurance work":"Uszkodzenia kolizyjne, sprawy ubezpieczeniowe","Not your fault? Read this":"To nie Twoja wina? Przeczytaj","Alloy wheel refurbishment":"Renowacja felg aluminiowych","Kerb damage, flaking lacquer and worn finishes made good, so the wheels match the rest of the car again. [Confirm that SVR offers this.]":"Otarcia o krawężnik, łuszczący się lakier i zużyte wykończenia naprawione, by felgi znów pasowały do reszty auta. [Potwierdzić, że SVR to oferuje.]","From [£000] per wheel":"Od [£000] za felgę","Kerb rash, peeling lacquer":"Otarcia o krawężnik, łuszczący się lakier","Polishing and paint correction":"Polerowanie i korekta lakieru","Swirl marks, faded lacquer and light scratches removed by machine, with no paint added. The gloss comes back, and so does the depth of colour.":"Hologramy, zmatowiały lakier i drobne rysy usuwane maszynowo, bez dodawania lakieru. Połysk wraca, a z nim głębia koloru.","[1 day]":"[1 dzień]","Dull or swirled paint":"Matowy lub zahologramowany lakier","Questions about repairs":"Pytania o naprawy","How do I know which repair I need?":"Skąd mam wiedzieć, jakiej naprawy potrzebuję?","Send us photos or call in. We will tell you plainly, and if a smaller repair will do, we will say so.":"Wyślij zdjęcia lub wpadnij. Powiemy wprost, a jeśli wystarczy mniejsza naprawa, też to powiemy.","Will the repaired panel match the rest of the car?":"Czy naprawiony element będzie pasował do reszty auta?","We match your paint code, test on a card and blend into the next panel. Paint fades over time, so we match what is on your car now.":"Dobieramy kod lakieru, testujemy na próbniku i wtapiamy w sąsiedni element. Lakier z czasem blaknie, więc dopasowujemy to, co jest na Twoim aucie teraz.","Do you work with insurers?":"Czy współpracujecie z ubezpieczycielami?","[Confirm.] Yes. For a claim that was not your fault, we send the photos and estimate to the insurer.":"[Potwierdzić.] Tak. Przy szkodzie, która nie była Twoją winą, wysyłamy zdjęcia i wycenę do ubezpieczyciela.","Is the estimate free?":"Czy wycena jest bezpłatna?","Yes, with no obligation.":"Tak, bez zobowiązań.","Not sure what you need?":"Nie wiesz, czego potrzebujesz?","Send us a photo on WhatsApp. We usually reply within [one working day].":"Wyślij nam zdjęcie na WhatsApp. Zwykle odpowiadamy w ciągu [jednego dnia roboczego].","Use the estimate form":"Użyj formularza wyceny","Spray gun painting car panels":"Pistolet lakierniczy lakierujący elementy auta","Technician removing a dent from a door":"Technik usuwa wgniecenie z drzwi","Technician spraying a car bumper":"Technik lakieruje zderzak","Car bodyshell in a spray booth":"Karoseria auta w kabinie lakierniczej","Painter spraying a stripped car in the booth":"Lakiernik lakieruje oczyszczone auto w kabinie","Technician polishing a car panel":"Technik poleruje element karoserii","Sample reading":"Przykładowy odczyt","Plastic":"Plastik","Bumpers are plastic, so we inspect them visually.":"Zderzaki są plastikowe, więc oglądamy je wzrokowo.","Within the normal range for factory paint.":"W normalnym zakresie dla lakieru fabrycznego.","Thicker than factory: this panel has been resprayed.":"Grubszy niż fabryczny: ten element był lakierowany.","Very thick: body filler is likely under the paint.":"Bardzo gruby: pod lakierem prawdopodobnie jest szpachla.","Front bumper":"Zderzak przedni","Boot lid":"Klapa bagażnika","Rear bumper":"Zderzak tylny","Front left wing":"Błotnik przedni lewy","Front left door":"Drzwi przednie lewe","Rear left door":"Drzwi tylne lewe","Rear left quarter":"Błotnik tylny lewy","Front right wing":"Błotnik przedni prawy","Front right door":"Drzwi przednie prawe","Rear right door":"Drzwi tylne prawe","Rear right quarter":"Błotnik tylny prawy","Factory paint.":"Lakier fabryczny.","Repainted.":"Przemalowane.","Filler likely.":"Prawdopodobna szpachla.","Photos of the damage (optional)":"Zdjęcia uszkodzenia (opcjonalnie)","Add photos":"Dodaj zdjęcia","Up to 5 photos. They are not uploaded to this website: they only leave your phone through WhatsApp.":"Do 5 zdjęć. Nie są wysyłane na tę stronę: opuszczają telefon tylko przez WhatsApp.","You can add up to 5 photos.":"Możesz dodać maksymalnie 5 zdjęć.","Remove photo":"Usuń zdjęcie","Photo of the damage":"Zdjęcie uszkodzenia","Shared. Make sure you pressed send in WhatsApp.":"Udostępniono. Upewnij się, że nacisnąłeś wyślij w WhatsApp.","Email cannot attach photos from this page. Please add them in your email app.":"E-mail nie może dołączyć zdjęć z tej strony. Dodaj je w aplikacji pocztowej.","Only what you send us: your name, phone number, registration, car details, a description of the damage and any photos. Photos stay on your device until you send them by WhatsApp. This website does not upload or store them.":"Tylko to, co nam przesyłasz: imię, numer telefonu, numer rejestracyjny, dane auta, opis uszkodzenia i dołączone zdjęcia. Zdjęcia zostają na Twoim telefonie, dopóki nie wyślesz ich przez WhatsApp. Ta strona ich nie wysyła ani nie zapisuje.","Open menu":"Otwórz menu","Close menu":"Zamknij menu","Language":"Język","Home":"Strona główna","Skip to content":"Przejdź do treści","Car body repair & paint · Jersey":"Blacharstwo i lakierowanie samochodów · Jersey","Written guarantee":"Gwarancja na piśmie","Also:":"Także:","Rust and underseal":"Rdza i zabezpieczenie podwozia","Paint protection":"Ochrona lakieru","Fleet and trade":"Floty i firmy","Rust":"Rdza","Protection":"Ochrona","Fleet":"Floty","Rust repair and underseal":"Naprawa rdzy i zabezpieczenie podwozia","After a crash? Do these four things first.":"Po kolizji? Najpierw zrób te cztery rzeczy.","It is stressful. This is the short version, whether you claim or pay yourself.":"To stres. Oto krótka wersja, niezależnie od tego, czy zgłaszasz szkodę do ubezpieczyciela, czy płacisz sam.","Check everyone is safe":"Sprawdź, czy wszyscy są cali","Move to a safe place if you can. Call 999 if anyone is hurt or the road is blocked.":"Jeśli możesz, przesuń auto w bezpieczne miejsce. Zadzwoń pod 999, jeśli ktoś jest ranny lub droga jest zablokowana.","Photograph everything":"Zrób zdjęcia wszystkiego","Both cars, the damage close up, the number plates and the position on the road.":"Oba auta, uszkodzenie z bliska, tablice rejestracyjne i miejsce zdarzenia na drodze.","Swap details":"Wymień dane","Name, phone, insurer and registration for every driver. Note any witnesses.":"Imię, telefon, ubezpieczyciel i numer rejestracyjny każdego kierowcy. Zanotuj świadków.","Send us the photos":"Wyślij nam zdjęcia","We will tell you what needs doing and whether you can choose your own repairer.":"Powiemy, co trzeba zrobić i czy możesz wybrać swój warsztat.","General guidance, not legal or insurance advice. Always check your policy. If anyone is hurt, call 999 first.":"To ogólne wskazówki, a nie porada prawna ani ubezpieczeniowa. Zawsze sprawdź swoją polisę. Jeśli ktoś jest ranny, najpierw zadzwoń pod 999.","Send photos on WhatsApp":"Wyślij zdjęcia na WhatsApp","Vans, company cars and small fleets":"Vany, auta firmowe i małe floty","One contact for bodywork and paint across your vans, company cars or small fleet. Planned around your schedule, with one clear estimate per vehicle. [Confirm with SVR.]":"Jeden kontakt do blacharstwa i lakierowania Twoich vanów, aut firmowych lub małej floty. Praca zaplanowana pod Twój grafik, z jasną wyceną na każde auto. [Potwierdzić z SVR.]","Ask about fleet work":"Zapytaj o floty","Do you offer a courtesy car, collection or delivery?":"Czy oferujecie auto zastępcze, odbiór lub dostawę?","[Confirm availability.] Ask when you book. If we cannot lend you a car, we will tell you before you leave yours with us.":"[Potwierdzić dostępność.] Zapytaj przy rezerwacji. Jeśli nie możemy pożyczyć auta, powiemy Ci przed zostawieniem swojego.","Do you repair rust and underseal?":"Czy naprawiacie rdzę i zabezpieczacie podwozie?","Yes. Jersey salt air is hard on sills, arches and the underside. We cut out rust properly and can renew underseal. [Confirm the exact treatment SVR offers.]":"Tak. Słone powietrze Jersey daje się we znaki progom, nadkolom i podwoziu. Wycinamy rdzę jak należy i możemy odnowić zabezpieczenie podwozia. [Potwierdzić dokładny zakres usług SVR.]","Do you work on hybrids and electric cars?":"Czy pracujecie z hybrydami i autami elektrycznymi?","[Confirm with SVR.] We work on all makes and models. For high-voltage work, we would use a qualified specialist and tell you before we start.":"[Potwierdzić z SVR.] Pracujemy ze wszystkimi markami i modelami. Przy pracach wysokonapięciowych skorzystamy z wykwalifikowanego specjalisty i powiemy o tym przed rozpoczęciem.","Can you recalibrate driver aids after a repair?":"Czy po naprawie można skalibrować systemy wspomagania kierowcy?","[Confirm with SVR.] Cars with cameras and radar behind the glass or bumper often need recalibration after a repair. We can arrange it with a local specialist.":"[Potwierdzić z SVR.] Auta z kamerami i radarem za szybą lub zderzakiem często wymagają kalibracji po naprawie. Możemy to zorganizować u lokalnego specjalisty.","How do I pay?":"Jak mogę zapłacić?","[Confirm accepted payment methods.] We give you a written estimate first, and an invoice when the car is ready.":"[Potwierdzić metody płatności.] Najpierw dajemy pisemną wycenę, a fakturę, gdy auto jest gotowe.","What to send":"Co wysłać","Your registration and the car model":"Numer rejestracyjny i model auta","Three photos: both sides, a close-up of the damage, and the whole car":"Trzy zdjęcia: oba boki, uszkodzenie z bliska i całe auto","What happened, and your preferred drop-off day":"Co się stało i w jaki dzień chcesz zostawić auto","Preferred drop-off day (optional)":"Preferowany dzień oddania auta (opcjonalnie)","Cookies":"Cookies","This website does not set cookies and does not load fonts or images from third parties. Everything it needs is served from this site.":"Ta strona nie używa cookies ani nie ładuje czcionek i obrazów od firm trzecich. Wszystko jest serwowane z tej strony.","Accessibility":"Dostępność","We aim to meet WCAG 2.2 AA: readable contrast, keyboard navigation, visible focus, large touch targets and support for reduced motion. If something is hard to use, call us and we will help.":"Chcemy spełniać WCAG 2.2 AA: czytelny kontrast, obsługa klawiaturą, widoczny fokus, duże przyciski i poszanowanie ograniczenia ruchu. Jeśli coś jest trudne w użyciu, zadzwoń, a pomożemy.","SVR painter spraying a car panel in the spray booth":"Lakiernik SVR nakłada lakier na panel w kabinie","Salt air and wet lanes find every sill, arch and seam. We cut out the rust, treat the metal, repair the panel and renew the underseal so it does not come straight back. [Confirm the exact treatment SVR offers.]":"Słone powietrze i mokre drogi docierają do progów, nadkoli i łączeń. Wycinamy rdzę, zabezpieczamy metal, naprawiamy panel i odnawiamy zabezpieczenie podwozia, żeby nie wróciło szybko. [Potwierdzić dokładny zakres usług SVR.]","[2 to 5 days]":"[2 do 5 dni]","Sills, arches, boot floors":"Progi, nadkola, podłoga bagażnika","Fresh paint needs looking after. A wax, sealant or ceramic coating helps it stay glossy and makes salt, bird lime and tar easier to wash off. [Confirm which products SVR uses.]":"Nowy lakier wymaga pielęgnacji. Wosk, sealant lub powłoka ceramiczna pomagają utrzymać połysk i ułatwiają zmywanie soli, ptasich odchodów i smoły. [Potwierdzić, jakich produktów używa SVR.]","New paint, dark colours":"Nowy lakier, ciemne kolory","Panels, doors, wings and the work behind them, repaired and finished to a safe standard. If it was not your fault, we can deal with the other driver’s insurer for you. [Confirm.] If the car has cameras or radar, we arrange recalibration after the repair. [Confirm.]":"Panele, drzwi, błotniki i praca pod nimi, naprawione i wykończone bezpiecznie. Jeśli to nie Twoja wina, możemy dogadać się z ubezpieczycielem drugiego kierowcy. [Potwierdzić.] Jeśli auto ma kamery lub radar, organizujemy kalibrację po naprawie. [Potwierdzić.]","Vans, company cars or a small fleet: one contact, one clear estimate per vehicle, and work planned around your schedule. [Confirm with SVR.]":"Vany, auta firmowe lub mała flota: jeden kontakt, jasna wycena na każde auto i praca zaplanowana pod Twój grafik. [Potwierdzić z SVR.]","Car in the workshop being checked underneath":"Auto w warsztacie sprawdzane od spodu","Technician applying protection to a painted panel":"Technik nakłada ochronę na lakierowany panel","Do you scan the car before and after a repair?":"Czy przed naprawą i po niej robicie skanowanie auta?","[Confirm with SVR.] Modern cars have sensors and computers. If a scan is needed, we arrange it with a local specialist and include it in the estimate.":"[Potwierdzić z SVR.] Nowe auta mają czujniki i komputery. Jeśli potrzebne jest skanowanie, organizujemy je u lokalnego specjalisty i uwzględniamy w wycenie.","How should I look after fresh paint?":"Jak dbać o nowy lakier?","Avoid washing the car for [confirm: about a week], and no wax or polish for [confirm: about a month]. We give you written aftercare when you collect.":"Nie myj auta przez [potwierdzić: około tygodnia] i nie nakładaj wosku ani polerki przez [potwierdzić: około miesiąca]. Przy odbiorze dostajesz pisemne wskazówki pielęgnacji.","What if something is not right after the repair?":"Co jeśli coś nie będzie dobrze po naprawie?","Tell us straight away. We will look at it and put it right. [Confirm the process.]":"Powiedz nam od razu. Sprawdzimy i naprawimy. [Potwierdzić proces.]","MOCKUP: example photos. [ ] = real workshop details to come.":"MAKIETA: zdjęcia przykładowe. [ ] = prawdziwe dane warsztatu do uzupełnienia.","Car body repair and paint in Jersey for dents, scratches and accident damage. Colour-matched to your paint code, finished so the repair disappears, and guaranteed in writing.":"Naprawa blacharsko-lakiernicza w Jersey: wgniecenia, zarysowania i uszkodzenia po kolizji. Kolor dopasowany do kodu lakieru, wykończenie, które ukrywa naprawę, i gwarancja na piśmie.","Colour-matched to your paint code":"Kolor dopasowany do kodu lakieru","Prepared, primed and painted in a controlled booth, then we deal with your insurer if you wish.":"Przygotowany, zagruntowany i pomalowany w kontrolowanej kabinie; jeśli chcesz, zajmiemy się ubezpieczycielem.","Both cars, a close-up of the damage, the number plates and the position on the road.":"Oba auta, zbliżenie uszkodzenia, tablice rejestracyjne i położenie na drodze.","Demo effect on a stock photo. Replace with the workshop’s own before-and-after photos, with each owner’s permission.":"Efekt demonstracyjny na zdjęciu z banku zdjęć. Zastąpić własnymi zdjęciami przed i po z warsztatu, za zgodą każdego właściciela.","A history report can show outstanding finance, past write-offs and mileage records from UK databases.":"Raport historii może pokazać zaległe finansowanie, wcześniejsze szkody całkowite i przebieg z baz danych Wielkiej Brytanii.","Every panel is checked in bright light before we call you.":"Każdy panel jest sprawdzany w jasnym świetle, zanim zadzwonimy.","Fresh jobs from the spray booth, before-and-after photos, and the odd classic. Follow SVR on Instagram.":"Świeże prace z kabiny, zdjęcia przed i po oraz od czasu do czasu klasyk. Obserwuj SVR na Instagramie.","Can you recalibrate driver-assistance systems after a repair?":"Czy po naprawie można skalibrować systemy wspomagania kierowcy?","[Confirm with SVR.] Cars with cameras and radar behind the windscreen or bumper often need recalibration after a repair. We can arrange it with a local specialist.":"[Potwierdzić z SVR.] Auta z kamerami i radarem za szybą lub zderzakiem często wymagają kalibracji po naprawie. Możemy to zorganizować u lokalnego specjalisty.","Do not wash the car for [confirm: about a week], and do not wax or polish it for [confirm: about a month]. We give you written aftercare when you collect.":"Nie myj auta przez [potwierdzić: około tygodnia] i nie nakładaj wosku ani polerki przez [potwierdzić: około miesiąca]. Przy odbiorze dostajesz pisemne wskazówki pielęgnacji.","Your registration and the car’s make and model":"Numer rejestracyjny oraz marka i model auta","Book your appointment now @svrje2023":"Zarezerwuj wizytę już teraz @svrje2023","Jersey, Channel Islands":"Jersey, Wyspy Normandzkie","Mockup: example photos. [ ] = real workshop details to come.":"Makieta: zdjęcia przykładowe. [ ] = prawdziwe dane warsztatu do uzupełnienia.","Mockup: example photos and text. Prices and times in [ ] to be confirmed with SVR.":"Makieta: przykładowe zdjęcia i tekst. Ceny i terminy w [ ] do potwierdzenia z SVR.","Mockup: concept page. Sample report only, not a real vehicle. [ ] = to confirm with SVR.":"Makieta: strona koncepcyjna. Tylko przykładowy raport, nie prawdziwe auto. [ ] = do potwierdzenia z SVR.","Car Body Repair & Paint in Jersey | SVR Sienna Vehicle Refinishing":"Blacharstwo i lakierowanie w Jersey | SVR Sienna Vehicle Refinishing","Car Body Repair Services in Jersey | SVR":"Usługi blacharsko-lakiernicze w Jersey | SVR","Used Car Bodywork Check in Jersey | SVR Car Check":"Kontrola blacharska aut używanych w Jersey | SVR Car Check","Hello SVR, I would like a free estimate.":"Dzień dobry SVR, chciałbym bezpłatną wycenę.","Registration":"Nr rejestracyjny","Car":"Samochód","Name":"Imię i nazwisko","What happened":"Co się stało","Preferred drop-off":"Preferowany dzień oddania","Estimate request":"Prośba o wycenę","Pre-purchase bodywork inspection for a car I am thinking of buying.":"Kontrola blacharska przed zakupem samochodu."},"ro":{"MOCKUP: free-licence example photos. [ ] = real workshop details to come.":"MACHETĂ: fotografii exemplu cu licență liberă. [ ] = datele reale ale atelierului urmează.","Services":"Servicii","Process":"Proces","Standards":"Standarde","Reviews":"Păreri","Contact":"Contact","Flawless":"Finisaj","finish.":"impecabil.","Every panel.":"Pe fiecare panou.","Refined over 20 years. Finished to perfection.":"Peste 20 de ani de meserie. Finisaj perfect.","Car body repair and paint in Jersey, for dents, scratches and accident damage. Colour matched to your paint code, finished so you cannot find the repair, and guaranteed in writing.":"Reparații de tinichigerie și vopsitorie în Jersey: lovituri, zgârieturi și daune de accident. Culoare potrivită după codul de vopsea, finisată astfel încât reparația să nu se vadă, cu garanție în scris.","Get a free estimate":"Cere o ofertă gratuită","WhatsApp your photos":"Trimite pozele pe WhatsApp","Call [01534 000000]":"Sună la [01534 000000]","Scratch repair":"Reparare zgârieturi","Dent removal":"Îndepărtare lovituri","Full respray":"Vopsire completă","Accident repair":"Reparații după accident","Colour matching":"Potrivire de culoare","Alloy wheels":"Jante din aliaj","Polishing":"Polish","Whatever happened to your car":"Orice s-a întâmplat cu mașina ta","Send us a photo and we will tell you plainly what it needs. Sometimes that is a small repair, not a respray.":"Trimite-ne o poză și îți spunem direct ce are nevoie. Uneori e o reparație mică, nu o revopsire.","Dents without the respray":"Lovituri fără revopsire","Paintless dent removal where the paint is unbroken. Panel work where it is not.":"Îndepărtare lovituri fără vopsire, când vopseaua e intactă. Dacă nu e, lucrăm panoul.","From [£000]":"De la [£000]","Accident and bumper repair":"Reparații după accident și bare de protecție","Prepared, primed and painted in a controlled booth, then handled with your insurer if you wish.":"Pregătit, grunduit și vopsit într-o cabină controlată, iar dacă vrei, ne ocupăm și de asigurator.","Free estimate":"Ofertă gratuită","Polish and protect":"Polish și protecție","Swirl marks, faded lacquer and light scratches brought back to a mirror shine.":"Zgârieturi fine, lac mat și zgârieturi ușoare revin la un luciu de oglindă.","[Confirm with the workshop which services it really offers, and prices.]":"[De confirmat cu atelierul ce servicii oferă cu adevărat și prețurile.]","Not your fault? We deal with the insurer.":"Nu e vina ta? Ne ocupăm noi de asigurator.","If someone else caused the damage, you should not have to chase anyone. We send the photos and the estimate to the insurers, handle the back and forth, and keep you updated until your car is home.":"Dacă altcineva a produs paguba, nu ar trebui să alergi după nimeni. Trimitem pozele și oferta asiguratorilor, ținem corespondența și te informăm până când mașina ajunge acasă.","In most cases you can choose who repairs your car":"În cele mai multe cazuri poți alege cine îți repară mașina","Photos and a written estimate sent straight to the insurer":"Poze și ofertă scrisă trimise direct asiguratorului","Updates by WhatsApp until the job is done":"Noutăți pe WhatsApp până se termină lucrarea","Tell us what happened":"Spune-ne ce s-a întâmplat","[Confirm SVR offers insurance claims handling, and check the wording with a Jersey insurer.]":"[De confirmat că SVR gestionează dosare de asigurări și de verificat textul cu un asigurător din Jersey.]","How your car comes back perfect":"Așa se întoarce mașina ta perfectă","Scroll to follow a repair from the first look to the keys in your hand.":"Derulează pentru a urmări o reparație de la prima verificare până ai cheile în mână.","Step 1":"Pasul 1","We look, you get a price":"Ne uităm și îți dăm un preț","Send photos or drop in. You receive a clear written estimate, usually within [one working day], with no obligation.":"Trimite poze sau treci pe la noi. Primești o ofertă clară în scris, de obicei în [o zi lucrătoare], fără obligații.","Step 2":"Pasul 2","Strip back and repair":"Demontare și reparare","Dents are pulled, rust is cut out, and the panel is prepared properly. This is where most of a good finish is won.":"Loviturile se scot, rugina se taie, iar panoul se pregătește corect. Aici se câștigă cea mai mare parte a unui finisaj bun.","Step 3":"Pasul 3","Your exact colour":"Culoarea ta exactă","Mixed to your paint code and tested on a spray-out card beside the car, then blended into the next panel.":"Amestecată după codul de vopsea și testată pe un carton lângă mașină, apoi fuzionată cu panoul alăturat.","Step 4":"Pasul 4","Baked in the booth":"Uscat în cabină","Dust-free spraying, then heat curing for a hard, glossy lacquer that lasts.":"Vopsire fără praf, apoi întărire la căldură pentru un lac dur, lucios și durabil.","Step 5":"Pasul 5","Polished by hand and machine":"Lustruit manual și cu mașina","Every panel is checked in bright light and polished until the repair disappears.":"Fiecare panou este verificat în lumină puternică și lustruit până când reparația dispare.","Step 6":"Pasul 6","Collect it, guaranteed":"Ridică-ți mașina, cu garanție","Cleaned inside and out, with a written guarantee. [Guarantee terms to confirm.]":"Curată pe interior și exterior, cu garanție în scris. [Condițiile garanției de confirmat.]","Before":"Înainte","After":"După","Demo effect on a stock photo. Replace with the workshop’s own before and after photos, with each owner’s permission.":"Efect demonstrativ pe o fotografie de stoc. De înlocuit cu fotografii înainte și după din atelierul propriu, cu acordul fiecărui proprietar.","See the difference":"Vezi diferența","Drag across the car. Our job is to make the repair impossible to find: same colour, same gloss, same finish as the factory.":"Trage peste mașină. Treaba noastră este ca reparația să fie imposibil de găsit: aceeași culoare, același luciu, același finisaj ca din fabrică.","Get yours looked at":"Cere o evaluare","Buying a used car? Check it first.":"Cumperi o mașină second-hand? Verific-o mai întâi.","A clean history does not mean a clean car. Hidden repairs, filler and resprays only show up when someone measures the paint.":"Un istoric curat nu înseamnă o mașină curată. Reparațiile ascunse, chitul și revopsirile ies la iveală doar când cineva măsoară vopseaua.","Pre-purchase bodywork inspection":"Inspecție de tinichigerie înainte de cumpărare","Before you buy, we check every panel with a paint thickness gauge and inspect the car in bright light. You get a short written report with photos, so you know exactly what you are paying for.":"Înainte să cumperi, verificăm fiecare panou cu un grosimetru de vopsea și inspectăm mașina în lumină puternică. Primești un raport scurt în scris, cu poze, ca să știi exact pentru ce plătești.","[Price to confirm with SVR]":"[Preț de confirmat cu SVR]","Example reading, for illustration":"Măsurătoare exemplu, doar ilustrativă","paint depth (µm)":"grosimea vopselei (µm)","Bonnet":"Capotă","Front wing":"Aripă față","Front door":"Ușă față","Rear door":"Ușă spate","Roof":"Plafon","A much thicker reading on one panel usually means it has been repainted.":"O valoare mult mai mare pe un panou înseamnă de obicei că a fost revopsit.","Book an inspection":"Programează o inspecție","See SVR Car Check":"Vezi SVR Car Check","Online history check":"Verificare istoric online","A history report can show outstanding finance, past write-offs and mileage records, from UK databases.":"Un raport de istoric poate arăta finanțări restante, daune totale anterioare și date despre kilometraj, din baze de date din Marea Britanie.","Best for cars with a previous UK registration":"Ideal pentru mașini cu înmatriculare anterioară în Marea Britanie","Paid service, run by a third party":"Serviciu plătit, oferit de o terță parte","Check a history online":"Verifică istoricul online","Opens carVertical, an independent website. SVR is not responsible for its reports. [Confirm which provider SVR wants to recommend.]":"Deschide carVertical, un site independent. SVR nu răspunde de rapoartele sale. [De confirmat ce furnizor vrea SVR să recomande.]","Our standards":"Standardele noastre","You expect a repair you cannot spot, and a workshop that keeps its word. This is what we commit to on every job.":"Aștepți o reparație care nu se vede și un atelier care își ține cuvântul. La asta ne angajăm la fiecare lucrare.","A written, itemised estimate":"Ofertă scrisă, detaliată","The price is agreed before any work starts. If anything changes, we ask you first.":"Prețul se stabilește înainte de începerea lucrărilor. Dacă se schimbă ceva, te întrebăm mai întâi.","Colour matched to your paint code":"Culoare potrivită după codul de vopsea","Checked on a spray-out card in daylight and blended into the neighbouring panel.":"Verificată pe carton la lumina zilei și fuzionată cu panoul vecin.","Progress updates":"Informări despre progres","Photos and a message at each stage, by WhatsApp or phone. [To confirm.]":"Poze și un mesaj la fiecare etapă, pe WhatsApp sau telefon. [De confirmat.]","Honest advice":"Sfat sincer","If a smaller repair will do, we will tell you, even when it costs us the bigger job.":"Dacă ajunge o reparație mai mică, îți spunem, chiar dacă ne costă lucrarea mai mare.","Inspected before handover":"Inspectată înainte de predare","Every panel is checked under bright light before we call you.":"Fiecare panou este verificat în lumină puternică înainte să te sunăm.","Guaranteed in writing":"Garanție în scris","[Guarantee terms to confirm with SVR.]":"[Condițiile garanției de confirmat cu SVR.]","[Insurer approvals, if held]":"[Aprobări de la asiguratori, dacă există]","[Trade body membership, if held]":"[Apartenență la o asociație de profil, dacă există]","[Manufacturer paint system, if used]":"[Sistem de vopsea al producătorului, dacă se folosește]","Only show an accreditation once SVR can prove it. Better a short, true list than a long one.":"Arată o acreditare doar când SVR o poate dovedi. Mai bine o listă scurtă și adevărată decât una lungă.","years of experience":"ani de experiență","vehicles repaired [to confirm]":"vehicule reparate [de confirmat]","average Google rating [to confirm]":"notă medie pe Google [de confirmat]","parishes covered":"parohii acoperite","Made for Jersey roads":"Făcut pentru drumurile din Jersey","Narrow lanes, hedges, coastal car parks and salt in the air. We see the same problems all year, and we know how to fix them.":"Străzi înguste, garduri vii, parcări de la mare și sare în aer. Vedem aceleași probleme tot anul și știm cum să le rezolvăm.","Hedge scrapes":"Zgârieturi de la gard viu","Fine scratches along one side. Often polish out; deeper ones need paint.":"Zgârieturi fine pe o parte. Adesea se scot cu polish; cele mai adânci cer vopsea.","Salt-air rust":"Rugină de la aerul sărat","Small bubbles near wheel arches and sills. Fix them early, before they spread.":"Bășici mici lângă pasajele roților și praguri. Tratează-le devreme, înainte să se întindă.","Car-park dings":"Lovituri din parcare","Shallow dents with unbroken paint can often be pushed out without a respray.":"Loviturile superficiale cu vopseaua intactă pot fi adesea împinse înapoi fără revopsire.","20+ years. Run by the people who do the work":"Peste 20 de ani. Condus de oamenii care fac treaba","SVR (Sienna Vehicle Refinishing) is owned and run by Guillermo Goveia and Gabriel Das Neves. When you bring your car in, you deal with them directly, from the estimate to the final check.":"SVR (Sienna Vehicle Refinishing) este deținută și condusă de Guillermo Goveia și Gabriel Das Neves. Când îți aduci mașina, vorbești direct cu ei, de la ofertă până la verificarea finală.","[Add a short line about their background, and a photo of both if they agree.]":"[Adaugă o scurtă descriere a experienței lor și o poză cu amândoi, dacă sunt de acord.]","See the work as it happens":"Vezi lucrul în timp real","Fresh jobs from the spray booth, before and afters, and the odd classic. Follow SVR on Instagram.":"Lucrări proaspete din cabina de vopsit, înainte și după, și câte un clasic. Urmărește SVR pe Instagram.","Follow @svrje2023":"Urmărește @svrje2023","Post shown as published on SVR’s Instagram. [Swap in more posts, or a live feed, later.]":"Postare afișată așa cum a fost publicată pe Instagramul SVR. [Mai târziu, adaugă mai multe postări sau un flux live.]","What customers say":"Ce spun clienții","Sample wording only. Use real reviews, with permission.":"Doar text exemplu. Folosește păreri reale, cu acord.","“Sample review: I couldn’t tell where the repair was. The colour match was spot on.”":"„Exemplu de părere: nu am putut găsi unde fusese reparația. Culoarea se potrivește perfect.”","[Customer name], St Helier":"[Numele clientului], St Helier","“Sample review: they dealt with my insurer and kept me updated every day.”":"„Exemplu de părere: s-au ocupat de asiguratorul meu și m-au ținut la curent în fiecare zi.”","[Customer name], St Brelade":"[Numele clientului], St Brelade","“Sample review: fair price, honest advice, and the car came back spotless.”":"„Exemplu de părere: preț corect, sfat sincer, iar mașina s-a întors impecabilă.”","[Customer name], Grouville":"[Numele clientului], Grouville","Questions we get asked":"Întrebări frecvente","Do I have to use my insurer’s repairer?":"Trebuie să folosesc atelierul asiguratorului meu?","[Confirm for Jersey insurers.] In most cases you can choose your own repairer. Check your policy, or ask us and we will help.":"[De confirmat pentru asiguratorii din Jersey.] În cele mai multe cazuri îți poți alege singur atelierul. Verifică polița sau întreabă-ne și te ajutăm.","How long will it take?":"Cât durează?","Small repairs can take a day or two. Larger jobs depend on parts and damage. We give you a date with your estimate.":"Reparațiile mici pot dura o zi sau două. Lucrările mari depind de piese și de avarie. Îți dăm o dată odată cu oferta.","Will the colour match?":"Se va potrivi culoarea?","We use your car’s paint code, test on a spray-out card and blend into neighbouring panels. Paint fades over time, so we match what is on your car now.":"Folosim codul de vopsea al mașinii tale, testăm pe un carton și fuzionăm cu panourile vecine. Vopseaua se decolorează în timp, așa că potrivim ce are mașina acum.","Is the estimate really free?":"Oferta este într-adevăr gratuită?","Yes, with no obligation. Photos give a good guide; we confirm in person.":"Da, fără obligații. Pozele oferă o idee bună; confirmăm personal.","Do you offer a courtesy car?":"Aveți mașină de curtoazie?","[Confirm availability.] Ask when you book.":"[De confirmat disponibilitatea.] Întreabă la programare.","Fill this in and press send. WhatsApp opens with your details ready, so you can add photos of the damage in the same chat. We usually reply within [one working day].":"Completează și apasă trimite. Se deschide WhatsApp cu datele tale gata, ca să poți adăuga poze cu avaria în aceeași conversație. De obicei răspundem în [o zi lucrătoare].","Start with your registration":"Începe cu numărul de înmatriculare","As shown on your Jersey number plate.":"Așa cum apare pe plăcuța din Jersey.","Car make and model":"Marca și modelul mașinii","Your name":"Numele tău","Phone":"Telefon","What happened?":"Ce s-a întâmplat?","We use your details only to reply to your enquiry. See our":"Folosim datele tale doar pentru a răspunde solicitării. Vezi","privacy notice":"nota de confidențialitate","Send on WhatsApp":"Trimite pe WhatsApp","No WhatsApp?":"Fără WhatsApp?","Send it by email instead":"Trimite pe e-mail în schimb","WhatsApp is opening with your message. Add photos of the damage in the chat, then press send.":"Se deschide WhatsApp cu mesajul tău. Adaugă poze cu avaria în conversație și apasă trimite.","Find us":"Unde ne găsești","[Address], [Parish], Jersey [JE_ ___]":"[Adresa], [Parohia], Jersey [JE_ ___]","Monday to Friday":"Luni până vineri","Saturday":"Sâmbătă","Sunday":"Duminică","Closed":"Închis","Map goes here":"Aici va fi harta","(free OpenStreetMap)":"(OpenStreetMap gratuit)","Privacy notice":"Nota de confidențialitate","Who we are":"Cine suntem","SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, [address], Jersey [JE_ ___]. Contact: [email@address].":"SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, [adresa], Jersey [JE_ ___]. Contact: [email@address].","What we collect":"Ce colectăm","Why we use it":"Pentru ce folosim","To reply to your enquiry, give you an estimate and carry out the repair. We do not sell your details or send marketing without asking first.":"Pentru a răspunde solicitării, a-ți da o ofertă și a face reparația. Nu îți vindem datele și nu trimitem reclame fără să întrebăm mai întâi.","How long we keep it":"Cât timp păstrăm","[For example, up to two years after your last job.] Then it is deleted.":"[De exemplu, până la doi ani după ultima lucrare.] Apoi sunt șterse.","Who else sees it":"Cine altcineva le vede","No one outside SVR, except the services you choose to contact us through. Messages sent by WhatsApp are also handled by WhatsApp (Meta).":"Nimeni din afara SVR, cu excepția serviciilor prin care alegi să ne contactezi. Mesajele trimise pe WhatsApp sunt prelucrate și de WhatsApp (Meta).","Your rights":"Drepturile tale","You can ask to see, correct or delete your details at any time. If you are unhappy with how we use them, you can complain to the Jersey Office of the Information Commissioner.":"Poți cere oricând să îți vezi, corectezi sau ștergi datele. Dacă nu ești mulțumit de modul în care le folosim, poți depune o plângere la Jersey Office of the Information Commissioner.","This website does not set cookies. It loads its fonts from Google Fonts. [Check before going live.]":"Acest site nu folosește cookie-uri. Încarcă fonturile de la Google Fonts. [De verificat înainte de lansare.]","[Template only. Have it checked against the Data Protection (Jersey) Law 2018 before the site goes live.]":"[Doar model. De verificat cu Data Protection (Jersey) Law 2018 înainte de lansarea site-ului.]","© [Year] SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, Jersey. Owners: Guillermo Goveia and Gabriel Das Neves. [Company registration number].":"© [An] SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, Jersey. Proprietari: Guillermo Goveia și Gabriel Das Neves. [Număr de înregistrare al firmei].","Book your appointment":"Programează-ți vizita","Call":"Sună","Estimate":"Ofertă","SVR logo":"Sigla SVR","Main":"Principal","SVR painter spraying a red car panel in the spray booth":"Vopsitor SVR care vopsește un panou roșu în cabina de vopsit","Technician removing a dent from a car door panel":"Tehnician care scoate o lovitură dintr-o ușă de mașină","Technician in protective suit spraying a car bumper":"Tehnician în costum de protecție care vopsește o bară","Technician polishing a car panel with a machine":"Tehnician care lustruiește un panou de mașină cu o mașină de șlefuit","Car before repair (demo effect)":"Mașina înainte de reparație (efect demonstrativ)","Car after repair":"Mașina după reparație","Compare before and after":"Compară înainte și după","Example paint thickness reading":"Exemplu de măsurătoare a grosimii vopselei","Accreditations":"Acreditări","Parishes we cover":"Parohiile pe care le acoperim","SVR painter spraying a red panel in the booth":"Vopsitor SVR care vopsește un panou roșu în cabină","5 stars":"5 stele","e.g. Volkswagen Golf":"ex.: Volkswagen Golf","e.g. scraped the rear door in a car park":"ex.: am zgâriat ușa din spate într-o parcare","MOCKUP: concept page. Sample report only, not a real vehicle. [ ] = to confirm with SVR.":"MACHETĂ: pagină concept. Doar raport exemplu, nu un vehicul real. [ ] = de confirmat cu SVR.","← SVR home":"← Prima pagină SVR","Know the car before you buy it.":"Cunoaște mașina înainte să o cumperi.","An independent bodywork and condition report for used cars in Jersey, carried out in person by the team at SVR.":"Un raport independent de tinichigerie și stare pentru mașini second-hand în Jersey, realizat personal de echipa SVR.","Registration of the car you are looking at":"Numărul de înmatriculare al mașinii pe care o vezi","Book a Car Check":"Rezervă un Car Check","See a sample report":"Vezi un raport exemplu","Why in person?":"De ce în persoană?","Jersey has no public vehicle history database. Online checks only cover cars with a UK past. So we check what matters most: the car itself.":"Jersey nu are o bază de date publică cu istoricul vehiculelor. Verificările online acoperă doar mașinile cu trecut britanic. Așa că verificăm ce contează cel mai mult: mașina în sine.","Factory paint":"Vopsea din fabrică","Repainted":"Revopsit","Filler likely":"Probabil chit","What we check":"Ce verificăm","About [45 minutes] at the seller’s address or at our workshop. [Confirm with SVR.]":"Aproximativ [45 de minute] la adresa vânzătorului sau la atelierul nostru. [De confirmat cu SVR.]","Paint depth on every panel":"Grosimea vopselei pe fiecare panou","Measured with a gauge, to find resprays and hidden repairs.":"Măsurată cu un aparat, pentru a găsi revopsiri și reparații ascunse.","Panel gaps and alignment":"Rosturi și aliniere a panourilor","Uneven gaps often point to an accident repair.":"Rosturile inegale indică adesea o reparație după accident.","Signs of accident damage":"Semne de daune de accident","Overspray, replaced panels, welds and filler.":"Pulverizare în exces, panouri înlocuite, suduri și chit.","Rust from salt air":"Rugină de la aerul sărat","Sills, wheel arches and underside, where island cars suffer most.":"Praguri, pasajele roților și partea de jos, unde mașinile din insulă suferă cel mai mult.","Identity matches the paperwork":"Identitatea se potrivește cu actele","VIN on the car compared with the registration document (VRD1).":"VIN-ul de pe mașină comparat cu certificatul de înmatriculare (VRD1).","Photos of everything":"Poze cu tot","Every finding photographed and included in your report.":"Fiecare constatare este fotografiată și inclusă în raport.","What you get":"Ce primești","A clear report on your phone, usually the same day. This is what one looks like.":"Un raport clar pe telefon, de obicei în aceeași zi. Așa arată unul.","SVR Car Check report":"Raport SVR Car Check","Example 5-door hatchback · Registration: SAMPLE":"Exemplu: hatchback cu 5 uși · Înmatriculare: EXEMPLU","Sample report, not a real vehicle":"Raport exemplu, nu un vehicul real","Repaired, structurally sound":"Reparat, solid structural","Two panels have been worked on. Fair to buy at the right price.":"Două panouri au fost lucrate. Acceptabil de cumpărat la prețul potrivit.","Rear right quarter: filler likely":"Aripă spate dreapta: probabil chit","Reading of 610 µm. Previous dent repaired with filler and repainted. Ask the seller about it.":"Valoare de 610 µm. Lovitură anterioară reparată cu chit și revopsită. Întreabă vânzătorul.","Check":"Verifică","Front right door: repainted":"Ușă față dreapta: revopsită","Reading of 342 µm. Good quality respray, colour match is close.":"Valoare de 342 µm. Revopsire de bună calitate, culoarea e apropiată.","Minor":"Minor","Sills and arches: light surface rust only":"Praguri și pasaje: doar rugină ușoară de suprafață","Typical for a coastal car. Treat within a year.":"Tipic pentru o mașină de la mare. Tratează în cel mult un an.","VIN matches the registration document":"VIN-ul se potrivește cu certificatul de înmatriculare","Chassis and windscreen VIN agree with the VRD1.":"VIN-ul de pe șasiu și parbriz coincide cu VRD1.","Photo: rear quarter":"Poză: aripă spate","Photo: door edge":"Poză: marginea ușii","Photo: sill":"Poză: prag","Illustration of the report format. Readings and findings are examples, not data about any real car.":"Ilustrare a formatului raportului. Valorile și constatările sunt exemple, nu date despre o mașină reală.","How it works":"Cum funcționează","Book":"Rezervă","Send the registration and where the car is. We confirm a time with you and the seller.":"Trimite numărul de înmatriculare și unde se află mașina. Stabilim o oră cu tine și cu vânzătorul.","We inspect":"Inspectăm","At the seller’s or at our workshop. You are welcome to come along.":"La vânzător sau la atelierul nostru. Ești binevenit să vii și tu.","You decide":"Tu decizi","Your report arrives on WhatsApp, with photos and our honest view.":"Raportul ajunge pe WhatsApp, cu poze și părerea noastră sinceră.","Prices":"Prețuri","[Prices and inclusions to be set by SVR.]":"[Prețurile și ce includ, de stabilit de SVR.]","Bodywork Check":"Verificare tinichigerie","Panel gaps and accident signs":"Rosturi ale panourilor și semne de accident","Photo report on WhatsApp":"Raport foto pe WhatsApp","Full Car Check":"Car Check complet","Everything in the Bodywork Check":"Tot ce include Verificarea tinichigeriei","Rust and underside inspection":"Inspecție de rugină și partea de jos","VIN and paperwork check":"Verificare VIN și acte","Written grade and buying advice":"Notă scrisă și sfat de cumpărare","What a Car Check cannot tell you":"Ce nu îți poate spune un Car Check","Outstanding finance or past ownership. Ask the seller for the VRD1 and receipts.":"Finanțări restante sau proprietari anteriori. Cere vânzătorului VRD1 și chitanțele.","Mileage history. Service records are your best guide.":"Istoricul kilometrajului. Cărțile de service sunt cel mai bun ghid.","Mechanical faults. For engine and gearbox, ask a mechanic too.":"Defecțiuni mecanice. Pentru motor și cutie, consultă și un mecanic.","If the car was previously registered in the UK, an online history check on its old UK registration can add finance and write-off records.":"Dacă mașina a fost înmatriculată anterior în Marea Britanie, o verificare online după vechiul număr britanic poate adăuga date despre finanțare și daune totale.","Questions":"Întrebări","Does the seller need to agree?":"Trebuie să fie de acord vânzătorul?","Yes. Most honest sellers are happy to. If a seller refuses an independent check, that tells you something too.":"Da. Majoritatea vânzătorilor cinstiți acceptă cu plăcere. Dacă un vânzător refuză o verificare independentă, și asta îți spune ceva.","Can you check a car outside Jersey?":"Puteți verifica o mașină din afara Jersey?","[Confirm with SVR. For example, Jersey only.]":"[De confirmat cu SVR. De exemplu, doar Jersey.]","Will you repair what you find?":"Veți repara ce găsiți?","Only if you ask. The report is independent, and you are free to get repairs done anywhere.":"Doar dacă ceri. Raportul este independent și poți face reparațiile oriunde.","SVR Car Check is a service of SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, Jersey.":"SVR Car Check este un serviciu al SVR – Sienna Vehicle Refinishing, Jersey.","Back to SVR":"Înapoi la SVR","Interactive sample panel map":"Hartă interactivă exemplu a panourilor","Car seen from above, front at the top":"Mașina văzută de sus, fața sus","ES":"ES","See all services":"Vezi toate serviciile","Jersey J registrations may not be covered":"Înmatriculările J din Jersey s-ar putea să nu fie acoperite","Change language":"Schimbă limba","Our services":"Serviciile noastre","SVR Services":"Servicii SVR","MOCKUP: example photos and text. Prices and times in [ ] to be confirmed with SVR.":"MACHETĂ: poze și text exemplu. Prețurile și termenele în [ ] de confirmat cu SVR.","Every repair, done properly.":"Fiecare reparație, făcută cum trebuie.","From a single scratch to a full respray, here is what we do, how long it usually takes, and what to expect. Not sure which one you need? Send us a photo.":"De la o simplă zgârietură la o vopsire completă, iată ce facem, cât durează de obicei și la ce să te aștepți. Nu știi de care ai nevoie? Trimite-ne o poză.","Scratches":"Zgârieturi","Dents":"Lovituri","Bumpers":"Bare","Respray":"Revopsire","Scratch and scuff repair":"Reparare zgârieturi și julituri","Hedge scrapes, car-park knocks and key marks. If the scratch has not gone through to the metal, it can often be repaired without painting the whole panel.":"Zgârieturi de la garduri vii, lovituri din parcări și urme de cheie. Dacă zgârietura nu a ajuns la metal, de multe ori poate fi reparată fără a vopsi tot panoul.","Usual time":"Durată obișnuită","[1 to 2 days]":"[1 până la 2 zile]","Price":"Preț","Best for":"Ideal pentru","Light to medium scratches":"Zgârieturi ușoare până la medii","Get an estimate":"Cere o ofertă","Where the paint is unbroken, we can often push the dent out from behind with no filler and no respray. Where it is not, we repair the panel properly and repaint it.":"Unde vopseaua e intactă, putem adesea împinge lovitura din spate, fără chit și fără revopsire. Unde nu e, reparăm panoul corect și îl revopsim.","[Same day to 2 days]":"[În aceeași zi până la 2 zile]","Car-park dings, hail, small dents":"Lovituri din parcare, grindină, lovituri mici","Bumper repair":"Reparare bare","Cracks, scrapes and splits are repaired, primed and painted to match the rest of the car. If a bumper is beyond saving, we tell you before replacing it.":"Crăpăturile, julirile și ruperile sunt reparate, grunduite și vopsite pentru a se potrivi cu restul mașinii. Dacă o bară nu mai poate fi salvată, îți spunem înainte de a o înlocui.","[2 to 3 days]":"[2 până la 3 zile]","Parking scrapes, minor impacts":"Julituri la parcare, impacturi ușoare","Full and part respray":"Vopsire completă și parțială","Faded, peeling or damaged paint brought back. We match your paint code, test it on a spray-out card, and blend into the next panel so there is no visible join. Everything is cured in the booth.":"Vopsea decolorată, cojită sau deteriorată, readusă la viață. Potrivim codul de vopsea, testăm pe un carton și fuzionăm cu panoul alăturat, ca să nu se vadă îmbinarea. Totul se întărește în cabină.","[Part: 2 to 4 days. Full: 1 to 2 weeks]":"[Parțial: 2 până la 4 zile. Complet: 1 până la 2 săptămâni]","Faded or damaged paint, colour changes":"Vopsea decolorată sau deteriorată, schimbări de culoare","Panels, doors, wings and the work behind them, repaired and finished to a safe standard. If it was not your fault, we can deal with the other driver’s insurer for you. [Confirm.]":"Panouri, uși, aripi și lucrările din spatele lor, reparate și finisate la un standard sigur. Dacă nu a fost vina ta, ne putem ocupa de asiguratorul celuilalt șofer. [De confirmat.]","[Depends on damage and parts]":"[Depinde de avarie și piese]","Free written estimate":"Ofertă scrisă gratuită","Collision damage, insurance work":"Daune de coliziune, lucrări de asigurări","Not your fault? Read this":"Nu e vina ta? Citește asta","Alloy wheel refurbishment":"Recondiționare jante din aliaj","Kerb damage, flaking lacquer and worn finishes made good, so the wheels match the rest of the car again. [Confirm that SVR offers this.]":"Daune de bordură, lac care se cojește și finisaje uzate refăcute, ca jantele să se potrivească din nou cu restul mașinii. [De confirmat că SVR oferă asta.]","From [£000] per wheel":"De la [£000] pe jantă","Kerb rash, peeling lacquer":"Julituri de bordură, lac cojit","Polishing and paint correction":"Polish și corecția vopselei","Swirl marks, faded lacquer and light scratches removed by machine, with no paint added. The gloss comes back, and so does the depth of colour.":"Zgârieturi fine, lac mat și zgârieturi ușoare eliminate cu mașina, fără a adăuga vopsea. Luciul revine, la fel și profunzimea culorii.","[1 day]":"[1 zi]","Dull or swirled paint":"Vopsea mată sau cu zgârieturi circulare","Questions about repairs":"Întrebări despre reparații","How do I know which repair I need?":"Cum știu de ce reparație am nevoie?","Send us photos or call in. We will tell you plainly, and if a smaller repair will do, we will say so.":"Trimite-ne poze sau treci pe la noi. Îți spunem direct, iar dacă ajunge o reparație mai mică, îți spunem și asta.","Will the repaired panel match the rest of the car?":"Panoul reparat se va potrivi cu restul mașinii?","We match your paint code, test on a card and blend into the next panel. Paint fades over time, so we match what is on your car now.":"Potrivim codul de vopsea, testăm pe un carton și fuzionăm cu panoul alăturat. Vopseaua se decolorează în timp, așa că potrivim ce are mașina ta acum.","Do you work with insurers?":"Lucrați cu asigurători?","[Confirm.] Yes. For a claim that was not your fault, we send the photos and estimate to the insurer.":"[De confirmat.] Da. Pentru o daună care nu a fost vina ta, trimitem pozele și oferta asiguratorului.","Is the estimate free?":"Oferta este gratuită?","Yes, with no obligation.":"Da, fără obligații.","Not sure what you need?":"Nu știi de ce ai nevoie?","Send us a photo on WhatsApp. We usually reply within [one working day].":"Trimite-ne o poză pe WhatsApp. De obicei răspundem în [o zi lucrătoare].","Use the estimate form":"Folosește formularul de ofertă","Spray gun painting car panels":"Pistol de vopsit care vopsește panouri de mașină","Technician removing a dent from a door":"Tehnician care scoate o lovitură dintr-o ușă","Technician spraying a car bumper":"Tehnician care vopsește o bară","Car bodyshell in a spray booth":"Caroserie de mașină într-o cabină de vopsit","Painter spraying a stripped car in the booth":"Vopsitor care vopsește o mașină demontată în cabină","Technician polishing a car panel":"Tehnician care lustruiește un panou de mașină","Sample reading":"Valoare exemplu","Plastic":"Plastic","Bumpers are plastic, so we inspect them visually.":"Barele sunt din plastic, așa că le inspectăm vizual.","Within the normal range for factory paint.":"În intervalul normal pentru vopseaua din fabrică.","Thicker than factory: this panel has been resprayed.":"Mai groasă decât cea din fabrică: acest panou a fost revopsit.","Very thick: body filler is likely under the paint.":"Foarte groasă: probabil chit sub vopsea.","Front bumper":"Bara față","Boot lid":"Capacul portbagajului","Rear bumper":"Bara spate","Front left wing":"Aripa față stânga","Front left door":"Ușa față stânga","Rear left door":"Ușa spate stânga","Rear left quarter":"Aripa spate stânga","Front right wing":"Aripa față dreapta","Front right door":"Ușa față dreapta","Rear right door":"Ușa spate dreapta","Rear right quarter":"Aripa spate dreapta","Factory paint.":"Vopsea din fabrică.","Repainted.":"Revopsit.","Filler likely.":"Probabil chit.","Photos of the damage (optional)":"Poze cu avaria (opțional)","Add photos":"Adaugă poze","Up to 5 photos. They are not uploaded to this website: they only leave your phone through WhatsApp.":"Până la 5 poze. Nu sunt încărcate pe acest site: pleacă de pe telefon doar prin WhatsApp.","You can add up to 5 photos.":"Poți adăuga până la 5 poze.","Remove photo":"Șterge poza","Photo of the damage":"Poză cu avaria","Shared. Make sure you pressed send in WhatsApp.":"Partajat. Verifică să fi apăsat trimite în WhatsApp.","Email cannot attach photos from this page. Please add them in your email app.":"E-mailul nu poate atașa poze de pe această pagină. Adaugă-le în aplicația de e-mail.","Only what you send us: your name, phone number, registration, car details, a description of the damage and any photos. Photos stay on your device until you send them by WhatsApp. This website does not upload or store them.":"Doar ce ne trimiți: numele, telefonul, numărul de înmatriculare, datele mașinii, o descriere a avariei și pozele atașate. Pozele rămân pe telefonul tău până le trimiți pe WhatsApp. Acest site nu le încarcă și nu le păstrează.","Open menu":"Deschide meniul","Close menu":"Închide meniul","Language":"Limba","Home":"Acasă","Skip to content":"Sari la conținut","Car body repair & paint · Jersey":"Tinichigerie și vopsire auto · Jersey","Written guarantee":"Garanție în scris","Also:":"De asemenea:","Rust and underseal":"Rugină și protecție anticorozivă","Paint protection":"Protecția vopselei","Fleet and trade":"Flote și firme","Rust":"Rugină","Protection":"Protecție","Fleet":"Flote","Rust repair and underseal":"Repararea ruginei și protecție anticorozivă","After a crash? Do these four things first.":"Ai avut un accident? Fă mai întâi aceste patru lucruri.","It is stressful. This is the short version, whether you claim or pay yourself.":"Este stresant. Aceasta este varianta scurtă, fie că faci reclamație la asigurare, fie că plătești singur.","Check everyone is safe":"Verifică dacă toată lumea este în regulă","Move to a safe place if you can. Call 999 if anyone is hurt or the road is blocked.":"Mută-te într-un loc sigur dacă poți. Sună la 999 dacă cineva este rănit sau drumul este blocat.","Photograph everything":"Fotografiază tot","Both cars, the damage close up, the number plates and the position on the road.":"Ambele mașini, avaria de aproape, numerele de înmatriculare și poziția pe drum.","Swap details":"Schimbă datele","Name, phone, insurer and registration for every driver. Note any witnesses.":"Nume, telefon, asigurător și număr de înmatriculare pentru fiecare șofer. Notează martorii.","Send us the photos":"Trimite-ne fotografiile","We will tell you what needs doing and whether you can choose your own repairer.":"Îți spunem ce trebuie făcut și dacă poți alege propriul service.","General guidance, not legal or insurance advice. Always check your policy. If anyone is hurt, call 999 first.":"Îndrumare generală, nu consultanță juridică sau de asigurări. Verifică întotdeauna polița. Dacă cineva este rănit, sună mai întâi la 999.","Send photos on WhatsApp":"Trimite poze pe WhatsApp","Vans, company cars and small fleets":"Dube, mașini de firmă și flote mici","One contact for bodywork and paint across your vans, company cars or small fleet. Planned around your schedule, with one clear estimate per vehicle. [Confirm with SVR.]":"Un singur contact pentru tinichigerie și vopsire pentru dube, mașini de firmă sau o flotă mică. Lucrare planificată după programul tău, cu o estimare clară pe vehicul. [De confirmat cu SVR.]","Ask about fleet work":"Întreabă despre flote","Do you offer a courtesy car, collection or delivery?":"Oferiți mașină de substituție, ridicare sau livrare?","[Confirm availability.] Ask when you book. If we cannot lend you a car, we will tell you before you leave yours with us.":"[De confirmat disponibilitatea.] Întreabă la programare. Dacă nu putem împrumuta o mașină, îți spunem înainte să o lași pe a ta.","Do you repair rust and underseal?":"Reparați rugina și protecția anticorozivă?","Yes. Jersey salt air is hard on sills, arches and the underside. We cut out rust properly and can renew underseal. [Confirm the exact treatment SVR offers.]":"Da. Aerul sărat din Jersey afectează pragurile, pasajele roților și partea de sub mașină. Îndepărtăm rugina cum trebuie și putem reface protecția anticorozivă. [De confirmat tratamentul exact oferit de SVR.]","Do you work on hybrids and electric cars?":"Lucrați cu mașini hibride și electrice?","[Confirm with SVR.] We work on all makes and models. For high-voltage work, we would use a qualified specialist and tell you before we start.":"[De confirmat cu SVR.] Lucrăm cu toate mărcile și modelele. Pentru lucrări de înaltă tensiune, apelăm la un specialist calificat și îți spunem înainte să începem.","Can you recalibrate driver aids after a repair?":"Puteți recalibra sistemele de asistență după o reparație?","[Confirm with SVR.] Cars with cameras and radar behind the glass or bumper often need recalibration after a repair. We can arrange it with a local specialist.":"[De confirmat cu SVR.] Mașinile cu camere și radar în spatele parbrizului sau barei au nevoie des de recalibrare după reparație. Putem aranja asta cu un specialist local.","How do I pay?":"Cum pot plăti?","[Confirm accepted payment methods.] We give you a written estimate first, and an invoice when the car is ready.":"[De confirmat metodele de plată.] Mai întâi îți dăm o estimare scrisă, iar factura când mașina este gata.","What to send":"Ce să trimiți","Your registration and the car model":"Numărul de înmatriculare și modelul mașinii","Three photos: both sides, a close-up of the damage, and the whole car":"Trei fotografii: ambele părți, avaria de aproape și mașina întreagă","What happened, and your preferred drop-off day":"Ce s-a întâmplat și ziua în care preferi să lași mașina","Preferred drop-off day (optional)":"Ziua preferată pentru predare (opțional)","Cookies":"Cookies","This website does not set cookies and does not load fonts or images from third parties. Everything it needs is served from this site.":"Acest site nu folosește cookies și nu încarcă fonturi sau imagini de la terți. Tot ce are nevoie este servit de pe acest site.","Accessibility":"Accesibilitate","We aim to meet WCAG 2.2 AA: readable contrast, keyboard navigation, visible focus, large touch targets and support for reduced motion. If something is hard to use, call us and we will help.":"Ne propunem să respectăm WCAG 2.2 AA: contrast lizibil, navigare cu tastatura, focus vizibil, butoane mari și respect pentru mișcarea redusă. Dacă ceva este greu de folosit, sună-ne și te ajutăm.","SVR painter spraying a car panel in the spray booth":"Vopsitor SVR aplicând vopsea pe un panou în cabină","Salt air and wet lanes find every sill, arch and seam. We cut out the rust, treat the metal, repair the panel and renew the underseal so it does not come straight back. [Confirm the exact treatment SVR offers.]":"Aerul sărat și drumurile umede ajung la fiecare prag, pasaj de roată și îmbinare. Îndepărtăm rugina, tratăm metalul, reparăm panoul și refacem protecția anticorozivă ca să nu revină repede. [De confirmat tratamentul exact oferit de SVR.]","[2 to 5 days]":"[2 până la 5 zile]","Sills, arches, boot floors":"Praguri, pasaje de roată, podeaua portbagajului","Fresh paint needs looking after. A wax, sealant or ceramic coating helps it stay glossy and makes salt, bird lime and tar easier to wash off. [Confirm which products SVR uses.]":"Vopseaua nouă are nevoie de îngrijire. Un ceară, sigilant sau coating ceramic ajută la păstrarea luciului și face sarea, excrementele de păsări și smoala mai ușor de spălat. [De confirmat ce produse folosește SVR.]","New paint, dark colours":"Vopsea nouă, culori închise","Panels, doors, wings and the work behind them, repaired and finished to a safe standard. If it was not your fault, we can deal with the other driver’s insurer for you. [Confirm.] If the car has cameras or radar, we arrange recalibration after the repair. [Confirm.]":"Panouri, uși, aripi și lucrul din spatele lor, reparate și finisate în siguranță. Dacă nu a fost vina ta, putem discuta cu asigurătorul celuilalt șofer. [De confirmat.] Dacă mașina are camere sau radar, aranjăm recalibrarea după reparație. [De confirmat.]","Vans, company cars or a small fleet: one contact, one clear estimate per vehicle, and work planned around your schedule. [Confirm with SVR.]":"Dube, mașini de firmă sau o flotă mică: un singur contact, o estimare clară pe vehicul și lucrare planificată după programul tău. [De confirmat cu SVR.]","Car in the workshop being checked underneath":"Mașină în atelier verificată pe dedesubt","Technician applying protection to a painted panel":"Tehnician aplicând protecție pe un panou vopsit","Do you scan the car before and after a repair?":"Faceți o scanare înainte și după reparație?","[Confirm with SVR.] Modern cars have sensors and computers. If a scan is needed, we arrange it with a local specialist and include it in the estimate.":"[De confirmat cu SVR.] Mașinile moderne au senzori și calculatoare. Dacă este nevoie de o scanare, o aranjăm cu un specialist local și o includem în estimare.","How should I look after fresh paint?":"Cum ar trebui să îngrijesc vopseaua nouă?","Avoid washing the car for [confirm: about a week], and no wax or polish for [confirm: about a month]. We give you written aftercare when you collect.":"Nu spăla mașina timp de [de confirmat: aproximativ o săptămână] și nu aplica ceară sau polish timp de [de confirmat: aproximativ o lună]. Îți dăm instrucțiuni scrise de îngrijire la predare.","What if something is not right after the repair?":"Ce fac dacă ceva nu este în regulă după reparație?","Tell us straight away. We will look at it and put it right. [Confirm the process.]":"Spune-ne imediat. Vom verifica și vom remedia. [De confirmat procesul.]","MOCKUP: example photos. [ ] = real workshop details to come.":"MACHETĂ: fotografii de exemplu. [ ] = date reale ale atelierului urmează.","Car body repair and paint in Jersey for dents, scratches and accident damage. Colour-matched to your paint code, finished so the repair disappears, and guaranteed in writing.":"Tinichigerie și vopsire auto în Jersey pentru lovituri, zgârieturi și daune din accidente. Culoare potrivită după codul vopselei, finisaj care face reparația să dispară și garanție în scris.","Colour-matched to your paint code":"Culoare potrivită după codul vopselei","Prepared, primed and painted in a controlled booth, then we deal with your insurer if you wish.":"Pregătit, grunduit și vopsit într-o cabină controlată; dacă vrei, ne ocupăm noi de asigurător.","Both cars, a close-up of the damage, the number plates and the position on the road.":"Ambele mașini, o poză de aproape a avariei, numerele de înmatriculare și poziția pe drum.","Demo effect on a stock photo. Replace with the workshop’s own before-and-after photos, with each owner’s permission.":"Efect de demonstrație pe o fotografie din bancă de imagini. Înlocuiește cu fotografii înainte și după ale atelierului, cu acordul fiecărui proprietar.","A history report can show outstanding finance, past write-offs and mileage records from UK databases.":"Un raport de istoric poate arăta finanțări restante, daune totale anterioare și kilometraj din baze de date din Regatul Unit.","Every panel is checked in bright light before we call you.":"Fiecare panou este verificat în lumină puternică înainte să te sunăm.","Fresh jobs from the spray booth, before-and-after photos, and the odd classic. Follow SVR on Instagram.":"Lucrări proaspete din cabină, fotografii înainte și după și câte un clasic. Urmărește SVR pe Instagram.","Can you recalibrate driver-assistance systems after a repair?":"Puteți recalibra sistemele de asistență pentru șofer după o reparație?","[Confirm with SVR.] Cars with cameras and radar behind the windscreen or bumper often need recalibration after a repair. We can arrange it with a local specialist.":"[De confirmat cu SVR.] Mașinile cu camere și radar în spatele parbrizului sau barei au nevoie des de recalibrare după reparație. Putem aranja asta cu un specialist local.","Do not wash the car for [confirm: about a week], and do not wax or polish it for [confirm: about a month]. We give you written aftercare when you collect.":"Nu spăla mașina timp de [de confirmat: aproximativ o săptămână] și nu aplica ceară sau polish timp de [de confirmat: aproximativ o lună]. Îți dăm instrucțiuni scrise de îngrijire la predare.","Your registration and the car’s make and model":"Numărul de înmatriculare și marca și modelul mașinii","Book your appointment now @svrje2023":"Rezervă-ți acum programarea @svrje2023","Jersey, Channel Islands":"Jersey, Insulele Canalului","Mockup: example photos. [ ] = real workshop details to come.":"Machetă: fotografii de exemplu. [ ] = date reale ale atelierului vor urma.","Mockup: example photos and text. Prices and times in [ ] to be confirmed with SVR.":"Machetă: fotografii și text de exemplu. Prețuri și termene între [ ] de confirmat cu SVR.","Mockup: concept page. Sample report only, not a real vehicle. [ ] = to confirm with SVR.":"Machetă: pagină concept. Doar raport de exemplu, nu un vehicul real. [ ] = de confirmat cu SVR.","Car Body Repair & Paint in Jersey | SVR Sienna Vehicle Refinishing":"Tinichigerie și vopsire auto în Jersey | SVR Sienna Vehicle Refinishing","Car Body Repair Services in Jersey | SVR":"Servicii de tinichigerie și vopsire în Jersey | SVR","Used Car Bodywork Check in Jersey | SVR Car Check":"Verificare caroserie auto second-hand în Jersey | SVR Car Check","Hello SVR, I would like a free estimate.":"Bună ziua SVR, aș dori o estimare gratuită.","Registration":"Număr de înmatriculare","Car":"Mașină","Name":"Nume","What happened":"Ce s-a întâmplat","Preferred drop-off":"Ziua preferată pentru predare","Estimate request":"Cerere de estimare","Pre-purchase bodywork inspection for a car I am thinking of buying.":"Verificare caroserie înainte de a cumpăra o mașină."}};
